t\",\"translation\":\"一件印有日语的T恤衫\"},{\"sentence\":\"What does the writing on the back say?\",\"translation\":\"背面的文字说什么？\"},{\"sentence\":\"a T-shirt with Japanese writing on it\",\"translation\":\"一件印有日语的T恤衫\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"d40d965c-4d77-4f3d-af1e-24fb0020eadb\",\"similarity_score\":0.625},{\"word_id\":\"d27109e0-3670-4346-8714-dbb906fa224d\",\"similarity_score\":0.32},{\"word_id\":\"ffd7472c-168b-47d9-bdb7-5af111e3f8c6\",\"similarity_score\":0.32}]',NULL,'书写；作品；著作；[法] 笔迹；书写（write的ing形式）','SYLLABUS',NULL),('08c9348a-0b12-4eaf-9777-ed4fcfced8fe','dumbness',NULL,'NOUN','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"But on the few occasions when this had happened he could never think of anything to say and he suffered agonies of embarrassment at his dumbness.\",\"translation\":\"但在少数场合，当这种情况发生时，他却根本想不起说什么话来，对于自己的垭口无言感到极大的苦恼和困惑。\"},{\"sentence\":\"That is why dumbness is most often the highest expression of happiness of unhappiness.\",\"translation\":\"因此沉默往往是幸福或不幸的最高表现形式。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Sometimes, Angela might still feel sad, missing her parents, feeling lonely, hating her dumbness or something.\",\"translation\":\"有时，安琪拉可能仍然失踪感到悲伤的时候，她的父母，觉得孤独，那恨他的沉默或什么的。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'无言，沉默','SYLLABUS',NULL),('08cc9056-82cb-4b1b-9118-5865042e727e','compare…with',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"英文释义：The police compared the suspect’s fingerprints with those found at the crime scene.\",\"translation\":\"中文释义：警方把疑犯的指纹和在犯罪现场发现的指纹作了对比。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"4c275fdd-3a9e-4ae0-b296-a0724f6f8775\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','比较，对比','SYLLABUS',NULL),('08d60065-4995-48a5-ad39-73a24f1213a2','gesture',NULL,'NOUN/VERB','senior','UK: /\'dʒestʃə /；US: /\'dʒɛstʃɚ /','[{\"phrase\":\"gesture recognition\",\"translation\":\"手势识别\"},{\"phrase\":\"make a gesture\",\"translation\":\"做手势，表示；做一个手势\"},{\"phrase\":\"gesture recognition\",\"translation\":\"手势识别\"},{\"phrase\":\"make a gesture\",\"translation\":\"做手势，表示；做一个手势\"},{\"phrase\":\"gesture recognition\",\"translation\":\"手势识别\"},{\"phras