 and dropped dead .\",\"translation\":\"他突发心脏病猝死。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She was pronounced dead on arrival at the hospital.\",\"translation\":\"到达医院时她被宣告已经死亡。\"},{\"sentence\":\"His fellow climbers had left him for dead on the mountain.\",\"translation\":\"他的登山伙伴以为他已死，便把他留在山上走了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We didn’t know if she was dead or alive.\",\"translation\":\"我们不知道她是死是活。\"},{\"sentence\":\"When they found him he was more dead than alive .\",\"translation\":\"他们发现他的时候，他已奄奄一息。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Her parents were long dead .\",\"translation\":\"她父母早就去世了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Her mother had been dead for ten years.\",\"translation\":\"她母亲去世十年了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Police are trying to contact the family of the dead man.\",\"translation\":\"警方在设法与死者的家属联系。\"},{\"sentence\":\"a pile of dead leaves\",\"translation\":\"一堆枯叶\"},{\"sentence\":\"the dead body of a young soldier\",\"translation\":\"一名年轻士兵的尸体\"},{\"sentence\":\"Two men were shot dead by terrorists.\",\"translation\":\"两名男子遭恐怖分子枪杀。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Magnus was found dead in his car.\",\"translation\":\"马格纳斯被人发现死在他自己的车里。\"},{\"sentence\":\"One man is still missing, presumed dead .\",\"translation\":\"仍有一人失踪，被推定已经死亡。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He suddenly had a heart attack and dropped dead .\",\"translation\":\"他突发心脏病猝死。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She was pronounced dead on arrival at the hospital.\",\"translation\":\"到达医院时她被宣告已经死亡。\"},{\"sentence\":\"His fellow climbers had left him for dead on the mountain.\",\"translation\":\"他的登山伙伴以为他已死，便把他留在山上走了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We didn’t know if she was dead or alive.\",\"translation\":\"我们不知道她是死是活。\"},{\"sentence\":\"When they found him he was more dead than alive .\",\"translation\":\"他们发现他的时候，他已奄奄一息。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Her parents were long dead .\",\"translation\":\"她父母早就去世了。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"0665cd09-bed8-4bee-946c-763633089974\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"15b9c14b-fc16-497c-a038-ed214ddabfaf\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"36049af8-3329-4a07-846f-a18018165d50\",\"e