"},{\"phrase\":\"moral hazard\",\"translation\":\"道德危机；由于投保人可能不可靠所冒的风险\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral standards\",\"translation\":\"道德标准\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral integrity\",\"translation\":\"节操；气节\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral value\",\"translation\":\"道德观，道德价值\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral behavior\",\"translation\":\"道德行为\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral principle\",\"translation\":\"道德原则\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral support\",\"translation\":\"精神支持；道义支持\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral philosophy\",\"translation\":\"道德哲学；伦理学\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral obligation\",\"translation\":\"道义上的责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral sense\",\"translation\":\"道德观念，道德意识；是非感\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral law\",\"translation\":\"n. 道德律\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral code\",\"translation\":\"道德准则\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral rights\",\"translation\":\"精神权利\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral courage\",\"translation\":\"道德勇气，道义勇气\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral issue\",\"translation\":\"道德问题\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral excellence\",\"translation\":\"道德美\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral psychology\",\"translation\":\"品德心理学\"},{\"phrase\":\"moral reasoning\",\"translation\":\"道德推理；道德理性\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"...Western ideas and morals.\",\"translation\":\"…西方的思想和道德。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder.\",\"translation\":\"对于判谋杀犯死刑这种涉及伦理道德的问题，有个观点并非难事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If we accept that certain babies should be allowed to die, we place doctors in a moral dilemma .\",\"translation\":\"如果我们同意应该允许某些婴儿死去，那就是让医生在道德上处于两难境地了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Man is gifted with a moral sense by which he distinguishes good from evil.\",\"translation\":\"人类天生有道德意识，能区分善与恶。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder.\",\"translation\":\"对于判谋杀犯死刑这种涉及伦理道德的问题，有个观点并非难事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If we accept that certain babies should be allowed to die, we place doctors in a moral dilemma .\",\"translation\":\"如果我们同意应该允许某些婴儿死去，那就是让医生在道德上处于两难境地了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Man is gifted with a moral sense by which he distinguishes good from evil.\",\"translation\":\"人类天生有道德意识，能区分善与恶。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder.\",\"translation\":\"对于判谋杀犯死刑这种涉及伦理道德的问题，有个观点并非难事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If we accept that certain babies should be allowed to die, we place doctors in a moral dilemma .\",\"translation\":\"如果我们同意应该允许某些婴儿死去，那就是让医生在道德上处于两难境地了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Man is gifted with a moral sense by which he distinguishes good from evil.\",\"translation\":\"人类天生有道德意识，能区分善与恶。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder.\",\"translation\":\"对于判谋杀犯死刑这种涉及伦理道德的问题，有个观点并非难事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If we accept that certain babies should be allowed to die, we place doctors in a moral dilemma .\",\"translation\":\"如果我们同意应该允许某些婴儿死去，那就是让医生在道德上处于两难境地了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Man is gifted with a moral sense by which he distinguishes good from evil.\",\"translation\":\"人类天生有道德意识，能区分善与恶。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"a707c37e-cfb6-48ba-99e6-125c0b098171\",\"similarity_score\":0.5}]','[{\"word_id\":\"9e1ed5c6-13b9-40df-89aa-d0bdea35dd7c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"100f4823-d118-40d3-998b-321958b17b5b\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"26cc8b62-6f66-464d-a8d5-913007047e4c\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"96677002-2248-4362-9cd8-06272cc0533a\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"197bca3d-6a76-48a4-9d8a-b46e3543d984\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"b500b95d-71c9-4598-a169-673750853d09\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"ebdc65b2-1084-4a1b-9116-2f49ceadb5a7\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"f34e020a-366d-4431-a214-65b42080712f\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','品德；品行','SYLLABUS',NULL),('0d9bd62b-e0e3-4081-a89a-a88275ae87da','maker',NULL,'NOUN','junior','UK: /\'meɪkə /；US: /\'mekɚ /','[{\"phrase\":\"decision maker\",\"translation\":\"决策人\"},{\"phrase\":\"coffee maker\",\"translation\":\"n. 咖啡壶；咖啡机\"},{\"phrase\":\"film maker\",\"translation\":\"n. 电影导演；电影制作人\"},{\"phrase\":\"market maker\",\"