ion\",\"translation\":\"环境适应\"},{\"phrase\":\"social adaptation\",\"translation\":\"社会适应，适应能力\"},{\"phrase\":\"cultural adaptation\",\"translation\":\"文化适应\"},{\"phrase\":\"dark adaptation\",\"translation\":\"（黑）暗适应；暗光适应\"},{\"phrase\":\"environmental adaptation\",\"translation\":\"环境适应\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"\\\"There can be no global agreement without adaptation assistance and because of the nature of climate impacts there will be much less global security without it,\\\" says the report.\",\"translation\":\"“没有对适应气候变化的帮助，就不可能达成全球协议，而且由于气候影响的本质，缺少了这种帮助，全球安全将大大降低。” 该报告说。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Branagh won two awards for his screen adaptation of Shakespeare\'s Henry the Fifth.\",\"translation\":\"布拉纳因他对莎士比亚的《亨利五世》的荧幕改编而获了两次奖。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Branagh won two awards for his screen adaptation of Shakespeare\'s Henry the Fifth.\",\"translation\":\"布拉纳因他对莎士比亚的《亨利五世》的荧幕改编而获了两次奖。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Branagh won two awards for his screen adaptation of Shakespeare\'s Henry the Fifth.\",\"translation\":\"布拉纳因他对莎士比亚的《亨利五世》的荧幕改编而获了两次奖。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Branagh won two awards for his screen adaptation of Shakespeare\'s Henry the Fifth.\",\"translation\":\"布拉纳因他对莎士比亚的《亨利五世》的荧幕改编而获了两次奖。\"},{\"sentence\":\"adaptation to the environment\",\"translation\":\"适应环境\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"4c0738ed-8ede-4e26-8ff0-53c5baaf4869\",\"similarity_score\":0.4}]',NULL,'变化；变种','SYLLABUS',NULL),('122c48fc-be29-4759-8cfb-102fbe2e0b73','read a newspaper',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"And though I could read a newspaper when I was four, scores were only pretty black squiggles.\",\"translation\":\"我在四岁时就能看报纸，但乐谱对我来说，只是一片黑不溜秋的花体字。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Acuteness of sight is difficult to define but if we were endowed with the eyesight of a kestrel it is estimated that we could read a newspaper at a range of 25 yards.\",\"translation\":\"食肉鸟视力的敏锐度是很维定义的，但是我们可以这样给鹰的视力加以说明，如果我们具有鹰的视力，那么我们可以在25码的距离之外可以看报纸。\"},{\"sentence\":\"“I couldn\'t even read a newspaper because the letters on the page looked like alphabet soup, ” she recalled during a recent interview in her home in Arlington, Va.\",\"translation\":\"在最近的一次在她的家乡（弗吉尼亚州阿林顿）对她的采访中她说：“那段时间，我几乎连报纸都不能读，因为那些报纸上的字母看起来就像字母汤。”\"}]',NULL,NULL,'看报纸','SYLLABUS',NULL),('122ff904-ddd7-4fcb-a9e3-e3974049bbc0','keep your desk clean',NULL,'','primary','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"It is your responsibility to keep your desk clean.\",\"translation\":\"保持课桌清洁是你的责任。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'保持课桌干净','SYLLABUS',NULL),('123087e1-04fb-4cd9-a077-26acee610ea0','sugar',NULL,'NOUN/VERB','junior','UK: /\'ʃʊgə /；US: /\'ʃʊgɚ /','[{\"phrase\":\"blood sugar\",\"translation\":\"[生化]血糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar content\",\"translation\":\"糖含量\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar cane\",\"translation\":\"甘蔗\"},{\"phrase\":\"cane sugar\",\"translation\":\"n. 蔗糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"reducing sugar\",\"translation\":\"还原糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"white sugar\",\"translation\":\"n. 白糖；精制糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"brown sugar\",\"translation\":\"红糖；黄糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"granulated sugar\",\"translation\":\"砂糖；粒状糖；晶粒砂糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar beet\",\"translation\":\"[植]甜菜\"},{\"phrase\":\"white granulated sugar\",\"translation\":\"白砂糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"residual sugar\",\"translation\":\"剩余糖分；香槟酒甜度；残留糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"icing sugar\",\"translation\":\"糖霜；糖粉\"},{\"phrase\":\"powdered sugar\",\"translation\":\"糖粉\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar mill\",\"translation\":\"糖厂\"},{\"phrase\":\"raw sugar\",\"translation\":\"粗糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"beet sugar\",\"translation\":\"n. 甜菜糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"rock sugar\",\"translation\":\"冰糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar syrup\",\"translation\":\"糖浆\"},{\"phrase\":\"refined sugar\",\"translation\":\"精制糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"starch sugar\",\"translation\":\"淀粉糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"blood sugar\",\"translation\":\"[生化]血糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar content\",\"translation\":\"糖含量\"},{\"phrase\":\"sugar cane\",\"translation\":\"甘蔗\"},{\"phrase\":\"cane sugar\",\"translation\":\"n. 蔗糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"reducing sugar\",\"translation\":\"还原糖\"},{\"phrase\":\"white sugar\",\"translation\":\"n. 白糖；精制糖\"},