ence\":\"It’s the clearest guide I’ve used.\",\"translation\":\"我从没用过这么清晰易懂的指南。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Perhaps I tried to cover too much and didn’t make myself clear (= express myself well ) .\",\"translation\":\"可能是我涉及的内容太多，没有表达清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you don’t understand, it’s best to say so and get things clear .\",\"translation\":\"如果你不明白，那就最好照直说并把事情弄清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If I catch you smoking again, you’re grounded. Do I make myself clear (= used when you are angry ) ?\",\"translation\":\"如果再让我发现你抽烟，我就罚你不准出门。我的话你听清楚了吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"He writes crystal clear (= very easy to understand ) prose.\",\"translation\":\"他写的散文通俗易懂。\"},{\"sentence\":\"clear instructions\",\"translation\":\"明确的指示\"},{\"sentence\":\"The question wasn’t very clear.\",\"translation\":\"这问题不是很清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It’s the clearest guide I’ve used.\",\"translation\":\"我从没用过这么清晰易懂的指南。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Perhaps I tried to cover too much and didn’t make myself clear (= express myself well ) .\",\"translation\":\"可能是我涉及的内容太多，没有表达清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you don’t understand, it’s best to say so and get things clear .\",\"translation\":\"如果你不明白，那就最好照直说并把事情弄清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If I catch you smoking again, you’re grounded. Do I make myself clear (= used when you are angry ) ?\",\"translation\":\"如果再让我发现你抽烟，我就罚你不准出门。我的话你听清楚了吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"He writes crystal clear (= very easy to understand ) prose.\",\"translation\":\"他写的散文通俗易懂。\"},{\"sentence\":\"clear instructions\",\"translation\":\"明确的指示\"},{\"sentence\":\"The question wasn’t very clear.\",\"translation\":\"这问题不是很清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It’s the clearest guide I’ve used.\",\"translation\":\"我从没用过这么清晰易懂的指南。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Perhaps I tried to cover too much and didn’t make myself clear (= express myself well ) .\",\"translation\":\"可能是我涉及的内容太多，没有表达清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you don’t understand, it’s best to say so and get things clear .\",\"translation\":\"如果你不明白，那就最好照直说并把事情弄清楚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If I catch you smoking again, yo