ation\":\"黑猩猩和海豚妈妈们远离群体打猎和收集食物，并保证他们所找到的食物都给孩子们。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It was, if I can give a chimpanzee language, I can empty the contents of his mind. He can tell me what he\'s thinking, how he sees the world.\",\"translation\":\"他的想法是，如果我能交给黑猩猩一种语言的话，我就可以掏空他的想法，他可以告诉我他在想什么，他是怎样看这个世界的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It only works within species. So, in another experiment they put a rabbit in the other room and the chimpanzee would slap the lever repeatedly to make the rabbit scream in pain and jump.\",\"translation\":\"这种结果只出现在同种动物上，在另一个实验里,他们在另一个房间放一只兔子,结果黑猩猩不停地拍杠杆,让兔子痛得上跳下窜，大声尖叫。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"6bc9b8bd-feb8-4403-958a-8a6c85686c9d\",\"similarity_score\":0.5},{\"word_id\":\"9c97531b-da8c-4396-889e-d0e423fe4e10\",\"similarity_score\":0.5}]',NULL,'黑猩猩','SYLLABUS',NULL),('1c953a7b-8796-4edc-99c5-df78289d4f53','personnel',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /pɜːsə\'nel /；US: /,pɝsə\'nɛl /','[{\"phrase\":\"technical personnel\",\"translation\":\"技术人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"personnel training\",\"translation\":\"人员培训\"},{\"phrase\":\"management personnel\",\"translation\":\"管理人员；管理人才\"},{\"phrase\":\"personnel management\",\"translation\":\"人事管理\"},{\"phrase\":\"qualified personnel\",\"translation\":\"人才；合格人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"service personnel\",\"translation\":\"保修人员；服务行业人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"personnel system\",\"translation\":\"人事制度；人事系统\"},{\"phrase\":\"security personnel\",\"translation\":\"治安保卫人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"military personnel\",\"translation\":\"军事人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"administrative personnel\",\"translation\":\"管理人员；行政人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"managerial personnel\",\"translation\":\"管理人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"personnel department\",\"translation\":\"人事部门\"},{\"phrase\":\"maintenance personnel\",\"translation\":\"维修人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"research personnel\",\"translation\":\"研发人员\"},{\"phrase\":\"personnel administration\",\"translation\":\"干部（人事）管理\"},{\"phrase\":\"personnel manager\",\"translation\":\"人事部经理\"},{\"phrase\":\"ministry of personnel\",\"translation\":\"人事部\"},{\"phrase\":\"company