 become newly infected with HIV, they often have a fever and minor illness at the time but rarely know what it is.\",\"translation\":\"当人们受艾滋病病毒重新感染时，他们常常同时有发烧和轻微不适，但很少知道它是什么。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Now they know how to fight it – by sleeping under insecticide-treated nets and seeking medical care at the dispensary when they have a fever.\",\"translation\":\"现在他们知道如何与该病作斗争 — 通过在经杀虫剂处理的蚊帐里睡觉和在发烧时到诊所寻求医疗。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'发烧','SYLLABUS',NULL),('1e80754f-d05c-41a1-b21f-a832488ed952','valley',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'vælɪ /；US: /\'væli /','[{\"phrase\":\"river valley\",\"translation\":\"河谷；山涧\"},{\"phrase\":\"happy valley\",\"translation\":\"欢乐谷（游乐场）；跑马地（香港一高级住宅区）\"},{\"phrase\":\"napa valley\",\"translation\":\"纳帕谷（美国加州葡萄酒的主要产地）\"},{\"phrase\":\"mountain valley\",\"translation\":\"山谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"optical valley\",\"translation\":\"光谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"rift valley\",\"translation\":\"裂谷；地堑\"},{\"phrase\":\"central valley\",\"translation\":\"n. [地质学]中央谷，裂谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"lily of the valley\",\"translation\":\"铃兰\"},{\"phrase\":\"dry valley\",\"translation\":\"干谷；涸谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"death valley\",\"translation\":\"死谷（美国西南部一地区，是世界最低和最干旱的地区之一）\"},{\"phrase\":\"the nile valley\",\"translation\":\"尼罗河流域\"},{\"phrase\":\"loire valley\",\"translation\":\"卢瓦尔河谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"sun valley\",\"translation\":\"太阳谷（美国爱达荷州中南部一座村庄）\"},{\"phrase\":\"valley floor\",\"translation\":\"谷底\"},{\"phrase\":\"valley water\",\"translation\":\"河谷水\"},{\"phrase\":\"river valley\",\"translation\":\"河谷；山涧\"},{\"phrase\":\"happy valley\",\"translation\":\"欢乐谷（游乐场）；跑马地（香港一高级住宅区）\"},{\"phrase\":\"napa valley\",\"translation\":\"纳帕谷（美国加州葡萄酒的主要产地）\"},{\"phrase\":\"mountain valley\",\"translation\":\"山谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"optical valley\",\"translation\":\"光谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"rift valley\",\"translation\":\"裂谷；地堑\"},{\"phrase\":\"central valley\",\"translation\":\"n. [地质学]中央谷，裂谷\"},{\"phrase\":\"lily of the valley\",\"translation\":\"铃兰\"},{\"phrase\":\"dry valley\",\"translation\":\"干谷；涸谷\"},{\"phra