ld see that Sam was close to tears .\",\"translation\":\"我看到萨姆都快哭了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Bridget suddenly burst into tears and ran out.\",\"translation\":\"布里奇特突然大哭着跑了出去。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He was fighting back tears as he spoke.\",\"translation\":\"他一边说，一边拼命忍住泪水。\"},{\"sentence\":\"A lot of people were moved to tears by his story.\",\"translation\":\"很多人都被他的故事感动得落泪。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He kissed her cheek, a gesture that brought tears to her eyes .\",\"translation\":\"他亲了亲她的脸，这个举动让她热泪盈眶。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I must admit I shed a few tears when the school closed.\",\"translation\":\"我必须承认，学校关闭时我掉过几滴眼泪。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I saw grown men reduced to tears that day.\",\"translation\":\"那天我看到成年男子都流下了眼泪。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘Please don’t talk like that,’ Ellen implored him, her eyes filling with tears .\",\"translation\":\"“请别那么说。”埃伦恳求道，眼里噙满泪水。\"},{\"sentence\":\"By this time, tears were streaming down my face.\",\"translation\":\"此时，我已泪流满面。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The tears he shed were tears of joy .\",\"translation\":\"他淌下的是喜悦的泪水。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Have you sewn up the tear in my coat?\",\"translation\":\"你把我大衣上那个撕破的口子缝起来了吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"This material does not tear.\",\"translation\":\"这种料子撕不破。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Most of her clothes had been torn to shreds .\",\"translation\":\"她身上的衣服大部分地方已经被扯得稀烂。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2df6ce25-429a-40da-b45a-b0722b14f3b4\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"e461d5ea-3ea6-4956-a23a-97a654111b86\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"2a7aa0f8-f560-45b0-9d64-fe75bc14d7cc\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"5caa019b-868d-49ed-b1f0-ae8004dcff66\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"775879eb-33b6-46ba-8929-46e331c0fe3c\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"9ff42100-3e3a-4aaa-bf84-08614fffd379\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"1a360073-f85c-4bec-87d6-9ff25408ee47\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"34c7f7b8-d4cd-4a90-9ee0-01b1351884d7\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','眼泪','SYLLABUS',NULL),('1f2355f4-7670-4d8e-9af9-5837c10dddfa','pump',NUL