ation\":\"她知道自己将内疚终生。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Raj spent his life caring for others.\",\"translation\":\"拉杰一辈子都在关爱他人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Bonington spent his entire adult life in France.\",\"translation\":\"博宁顿成年后就一直在法国生活。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We don’t know much about the poet’s early life (= when he was young ).\",\"translation\":\"我们对这位诗人的早年生活所知甚少。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Poor diet can lead to a whole range of diseases in later life (= when you are older ).\",\"translation\":\"饮食不良会在晚年引发各种疾病。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She married late in life (= when she was fairly old ).\",\"translation\":\"她结婚晚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He’s a life member (= continuing until he dies ) of the club.\",\"translation\":\"他是俱乐部的终身会员。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Learning goes on throughout life.\",\"translation\":\"学习是一生的事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"You have your whole life ahead of you.\",\"translation\":\"你前面还有漫长的人生呢。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I’ve known John all my life (= since I was born ).\",\"translation\":\"我从小就认识约翰了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"His main aim in life was to have fun.\",\"translation\":\"他人生的主要目标就是享乐。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It was one of the best days of my life.\",\"translation\":\"那是我一生中最快乐的时光之一。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The accident scarred him for life (= for the rest of his life ).\",\"translation\":\"这场事故给他留下了终生的创伤。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She knew she’d feel guilty for the rest of her life.\",\"translation\":\"她知道自己将内疚终生。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Raj spent his life caring for others.\",\"translation\":\"拉杰一辈子都在关爱他人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Bonington spent his entire adult life in France.\",\"translation\":\"博宁顿成年后就一直在法国生活。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We don’t know much about the poet’s early life (= when he was young ).\",\"translation\":\"我们对这位诗人的早年生活所知甚少。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Poor diet can lead to a whole range of diseases in later life (= when you are older ).\",\"translation\":\"饮食不良会在晚年引发各种疾病。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She married late in life (= when she was fairly old ).\",\"translation\":\"她结婚晚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He’s a life member (= continuing u