\"translation\":\"她的8岁生日\"},{\"sentence\":\"But the eighth most-important invention of all time?\",\"translation\":\"真的是整个时代第八项最重要的发明吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"When her eighth child was still an infant, she became pregnant again.\",\"translation\":\"当她第八个孩子还是小婴儿的时候，她又怀孕了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"On my eighth day at Bastion, preparing to leave, I witness one last trauma. A British soldier is brought in by Chinook and transferred to the operating room, his lower right leg blown off by an IED.\",\"translation\":\"到达基地的第八天，我正准备离开，目击了最后一件让人心碎的场景，一架支努干送来一名英国士兵，转移他到手术室做手术，他的右小腿被简易炸弹炸飞。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But the eighth most-important invention of all time?\",\"translation\":\"真的是整个时代第八项最重要的发明吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"When her eighth child was still an infant, she became pregnant again.\",\"translation\":\"当她第八个孩子还是小婴儿的时候，她又怀孕了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I might do an eighth book for charity, a kind of encyclopaedia of the world so that I could use all the extra material that\'s not in the books ... we\'ll see!\",\"translation\":\"我可能出于慈善的目的写第八本书，大概是有关这个世界的百科全书，这样我可以使用书中没能出现的所有额外材料······敬请期待！\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"a88a32f8-c5ba-4c74-abce-2a6130501486\",\"similarity_score\":0.7142857142857143},{\"word_id\":\"2f827330-f365-4858-a377-da76f82ab177\",\"similarity_score\":0.625},{\"word_id\":\"0a0f1cbb-50d7-4a18-b994-7f21f4be28f4\",\"similarity_score\":0.5},{\"word_id\":\"3a3f3323-2fe4-410c-b945-d2c18bdac11b\",\"similarity_score\":0.3125}]','[{\"word_id\":\"1893658f-2c6a-46eb-80cf-8e7ddb096497\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"3861258b-375c-49fe-9348-f250e22655b8\",\"edit_distance\":1}]','第八的；八分之一的；第八；八分之一','SYLLABUS',NULL),('3aa78f1e-fe7d-4b97-8cb2-e6e3b0f2ea77','go through',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"The bill might have gone through if the economy was growing.\",\"translation\":\"如果经济保持增长的话，那个议案或许已经获得通过了。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"987d1eee-0ec8-4ad4-9765-f1010124e7a9\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','穿过','SYLLABUS',NULL),('3ab024a7-1505-45e6-8071-d47866eb6ea3','at work',NULL,'','junior