rican worker, American business and American ingenuity.\",\"translation\":\"此外，正如总统上周所言，任何人都不应该小看美国的工人、美国的企业和美国的独创性。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"a9d13532-fc58-42f0-8b4b-7b0ef89d8af3\",\"similarity_score\":0.42857142857142855},{\"word_id\":\"f6021524-78fc-4e76-afb4-7e25b558cec8\",\"similarity_score\":0.42857142857142855}]',NULL,'独创性，灵活性','SYLLABUS',NULL),('3b2bb68b-e6e3-4bd8-ae88-e960469aa696','any',NULL,'','primary','UK: /\'enɪ /；US: /\'ɛni /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Any child who breaks the rules will be punished.\",\"translation\":\"凡违反规定的孩子都要受罚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Always check the details carefully before you sign any written agreement.\",\"translation\":\"签署任何书面协议之前都要仔细核对细节。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I can see you any time on Monday.\",\"translation\":\"星期一我随时都能见你。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If I can help in any way, let me know.\",\"translation\":\"要是我能帮上忙的话，就告诉我一声。\"},{\"sentence\":\"This excuse was as good as any other .\",\"translation\":\"这个借口和其他借口如出一辙。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"1069668e-b0e1-4d2d-9535-331d1d69eefa\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"484e0ad0-6d44-41e4-b578-c28bc6f0a77f\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"8021d0a6-09c6-411b-9cb8-09b2c18c0e6c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"9e435792-49e1-4d95-ac44-9261a81817dd\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"c799c156-6466-42d5-baba-a939a81420b3\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"b4d5dde1-bcf5-4a17-a35f-e9e6a640a51b\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"0b07c508-2e48-4a0b-81cf-2f8c4acc349f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"44009f8e-167c-4788-bac7-16e7cc5f329f\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','任何的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('3b37f57d-a98c-41f3-9cf1-a30ab261cb77','all at once',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"He thought of the coffin, and it hit him all at once—the dark and the stupid helplessness he felt.\",\"translation\":\"他想到了棺材，他突然生出如被雷击的感觉—仿佛被黑暗和愚蠢的无助感淹没了一样。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'突然，忽然','SYLLABUS',NULL),('3b39c6da-ca56-49cd-9fca-e34f40e4484d','pan',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /pæn /；US: /pæn /','[{\"phrase\":\"pots a