e religious scholars say so, she will engage in Moslem operations: suicide attacks.\",\"translation\":\"她告诉我如果宗教学者希望他们那么做，她也将义无反顾的采取穆斯林的反抗活动—自杀攻击。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The Buddhist, the Christian, the Moslem, and the Jew may all get answers to their prayers, in spite of the enormous differences among their stated beliefs.\",\"translation\":\"佛教徒、基督教徒、伊斯兰教徒和犹太教徒，尽管他们所宣称的信仰有极大的不同，但是，他们的祈祷大概都能得到回应。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"762a2e52-8d4f-4d76-b096-6e780d31d405\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"ef50a5df-1dc1-44d4-ac87-04e338d302a5\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','穆斯林的；伊斯兰教的；回教的；穆斯林；穆罕默德信徒；伊斯兰','SYLLABUS',NULL),('56fc74fd-1290-45f0-a7fa-59ab96ddfd86','care for',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"a250dd69-d58d-4923-bedd-02c184bb0236\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','照顾，非常喜欢','SYLLABUS',NULL),('56fd1036-a9b3-41b3-826c-bd2f7810e99e','the Andes',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Meanwhile, in Bolivia, halfway around the world and smack in the middle of the Andes, the controversy is causing chuckles.\",\"translation\":\"与此同时，在玻利维亚，在半个世界以及中东的安第斯山脉，这个争议引发了轻笑。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Even before it blooms, though, the Queen of the Andes has a regal presence, towering up to 40 feet (12 meters) in its mountain habitats of Peru and Bolivia.\",\"translation\":\"在开花前，“安弟斯女王”就非常引人注目了，它形状如塔，能长高到40英尺（12米），只在秘鲁与玻利维亚的山地中生长。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'安第斯山脉','SYLLABUS',NULL),('571e3fce-31f1-4974-b545-70df82597976','Isaac Asimov',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"As Isaac Asimov once commented, we scored a touchdown, then took our football and went home.\",\"translation\":\"正如艾萨克·阿西莫夫评论的那样，我们只赢得一次达阵，然后便收起球回家了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"One of the most celebrated science fiction authors, Isaac Asimov, outlined \'Three Laws of Robotics\' in a novel featuring human-like robots. The rules were designed to protect people from harm.\",\"translation\":\"最著名的科幻小说作者之一，艾萨克·阿西莫夫，在一本以仿生机器人为特写的小说中，他概述了“机器人三定律”，旨在保护人类免受伤害。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Isaac Asimov is the only author to have a book in every Dewey-d