e\":\"digital readout\",\"translation\":\"[计]数字读出；数字尺\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"The text builds up tension,and you hear this read out loud, and it keeps building up this tension, but then the seventh seal is such a anticlimax: silence in heaven for a half an hour.\",\"translation\":\"这本书营造出紧张感，人们听到它被大声朗读出来，而且它还持续营造紧张感，到了第七印，却一点高潮都没有：,“天上寂静约有二刻\"}]',NULL,NULL,'朗读；宣读','SYLLABUS',NULL),('57f5d97a-1483-4dc1-bcfd-7e6029fb0c2c','complain',NULL,'VERB','junior','UK: /kəm\'pleɪn /；US: /kəm\'plen /','[{\"phrase\":\"complain about\",\"translation\":\"抱怨\"},{\"phrase\":\"complain of\",\"translation\":\"n. 抱怨；抗议\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Miners have complained bitterly that the government did not fulfil their promises.\",\"translation\":\"矿工们已愤愤地抱怨政府没有兑现他们的承诺。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The couple complained about the high cost of visiting Europe.\",\"translation\":\"这对夫妇抱怨了游览欧洲的高昂花费。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I shouldn\'t complain, I\'ve got a good job to go back to.\",\"translation\":\"我不该抱怨，我已有可回去干的一份好工作。\"},{\"sentence\":\"\\\"I wish someone would do something about it,\\\" he complained.\",\"translation\":\"“我希望有人能对此做点什么，”他抱怨道。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"7a1da8b9-3000-4c31-a640-1f734402162e\",\"edit_distance\":1}]','抱怨， 诉苦； 投诉， 控告','SYLLABUS',NULL),('57f69ed6-941a-4c33-ae79-1c8fa821e7a6','responsibility',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /rɪˌspɒnsəˈbɪlətɪ /；US: /rɪˌspɑːnsəˈbɪləti /','[{\"phrase\":\"responsibility for\",\"translation\":\"责任；负责\"},{\"phrase\":\"sense of responsibility\",\"translation\":\"责任感，责任心\"},{\"phrase\":\"social responsibility\",\"translation\":\"社会责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"responsibility system\",\"translation\":\"责任制\"},{\"phrase\":\"take responsibility\",\"translation\":\"承担责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal responsibility\",\"translation\":\"法律责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"take responsibility for\",\"translation\":\"对…负责\"},{\"phrase\":\"criminal responsibility\",\"translation\":\"刑事责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"corporate social responsibility\",\"translation\":\"企业的社会责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"personal responsibility