inegar and brown paper.\",\"translation\":\"用醋和棕色纸张包扎。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The sugared vinegar is refined from the sugarcane and pine.\",\"translation\":\"加糖的醋是从甘蔗和松木中精炼出来的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Can we have some salt / pepper / vinegar / mustard, please?\",\"translation\":\"可以帮我加一些盐、胡椒粉、醋、芥末吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"The  sugared  vinegar is  refined from the sugarcane and  pine.\",\"translation\":\"加糖的醋是从甘蔗和松木中精炼出来的.\"},{\"sentence\":\"To make the red-wine vinaigrette, whisk together the oil, vinegar and mustard in a medium bowl until well combined.\",\"translation\":\"制作红酒醋油沙司，将油、醋和芥末放在一个中等大小的碗里一起搅拌，直到混合均匀。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In cooking, vinegar can be used alone or to add flavor without calories to our food, but what will it do if we use it on our hair?\",\"translation\":\"在烹饪中，醋可以单独食用，也可以用作食物调味料不附加任何卡路里，但如果我们把它涂抹到头发上呢？\"},{\"sentence\":\"The  sugared  vinegar is  refined from the sugarcane and  pine.\",\"translation\":\"加糖的醋是从甘蔗和松木中精炼出来的.\"},{\"sentence\":\"To make the red-wine vinaigrette, whisk together the oil, vinegar and mustard in a medium bowl until well combined.\",\"translation\":\"制作红酒醋油沙司，将油、醋和芥末放在一个中等大小的碗里一起搅拌，直到混合均匀。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But before you opt for south of the border fare without flair, consider this: Two of the product\'s ingredients, vinegar and salt, in combination seem to cause a reaction that cleans the pennies.\",\"translation\":\"但在你没有准备好去南部边境生活的时候：要考虑两种产品的成分，醋和盐，这一组合的联合使用，似乎可以引起一个清洗金钱的反作用。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The  sugared  vinegar is  refined from the sugarcane and  pine.\",\"translation\":\"加糖的醋是从甘蔗和松木中精炼出来的.\"},{\"sentence\":\"To make the red-wine vinaigrette, whisk together the oil, vinegar and mustard in a medium bowl until well combined.\",\"translation\":\"制作红酒醋油沙司，将油、醋和芥末放在一个中等大小的碗里一起搅拌，直到混合均匀。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'醋','SYLLABUS',NULL),('5fd6d712-2848-4459-9c06-63d010eceb7a','alcohol',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'ælkəhɒl /；US: /\'ælkəhɔl /','[{\"phrase\":\"polyvinyl alcohol\",\"translation\":\"聚乙烯醇\"},{\"phrase\":\"ethyl alcohol\",\"trans