\",\"translation\":\"区别于…\"},{\"phrase\":\"know better\",\"translation\":\"有头脑；明事理；不会上当\"},{\"phrase\":\"know nothing about\",\"translation\":\"一无所知\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Who knows the answer?\",\"translation\":\"谁知道答案？\"},{\"sentence\":\"There are instructions telling you everything you need to know.\",\"translation\":\"操作指南会告诉你所有须知事项。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Didn’t you know that?\",\"translation\":\"你不知道那件事吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I know all about David and what he’s been up to!\",\"translation\":\"我对戴维和他一直在干什么都知道得一清二楚！\"},{\"sentence\":\"Let me know (= tell me ) what time you’re planning to arrive.\",\"translation\":\"请告诉我你打算什么时候到。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I thought you’d want to know immediately.\",\"translation\":\"我以为你想马上知道。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you must know, I was with James last night (= used when you are angry because someone wants to know something ).\",\"translation\":\"如果你非要知道的话，我昨晚是和詹姆斯在一起。\"},{\"sentence\":\"How did he know (= how did he find information about ) our names?\",\"translation\":\"他是怎么知道我们姓名的？\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"a4f426ea-1055-4eb2-b440-4090ed502ac3\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"47e9505c-c3e4-461c-9bfe-c0dd328e608d\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"840e9b9e-c5af-4978-9b95-a0f90def3cb2\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','知道','SYLLABUS',NULL),('60ab8cab-288e-420b-bfd1-8495eb9eb53a','atom',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'ætəm /；US: /\'ætəm /','[{\"phrase\":\"hydrogen atom\",\"translation\":\"氢原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"atom bomb\",\"translation\":\"原子弹\"},{\"phrase\":\"bohr atom\",\"translation\":\"玻尔氏原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"neutral atom\",\"translation\":\"中性原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"hydrogen atom\",\"translation\":\"氢原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"atom bomb\",\"translation\":\"原子弹\"},{\"phrase\":\"bohr atom\",\"translation\":\"玻尔氏原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"neutral atom\",\"translation\":\"中性原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"hydrogen atom\",\"translation\":\"氢原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"atom bomb\",\"translation\":\"原子弹\"},{\"phrase\":\"bohr atom\",\"translation\":\"玻尔氏原子\"},{\"phrase\":\"neutral atom\"