"},{\"sentence\":\"At least with Valentine’s Day and your anniversary you only have to buy a card for one person (in most states).\",\"translation\":\"至少在情人节和结婚周年里，你只要买一张卡片给一个人（在绝大多数州如此）。\"},{\"sentence\":\"And if, however, they forget to make romantic gestures for the special day, the best excuse, in Gu’s words, is that “they say every day with your true love is Valentine’s Day”.\",\"translation\":\"然而，如果男人们忘了在这个特殊的日子营造浪漫之举，那最好的借口，用顾小白的话说，就是“他们都说与自己心爱的人度过的每一天都是情人节”。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'情人节','SYLLABUS',NULL),('60b8315d-bd4d-49e2-b6b7-1a11d7a1016a','fashion',NULL,'NOUN','junior','UK: /\'fæʃn /；US: /\'fæʃən /','[{\"phrase\":\"fashion design\",\"translation\":\"服装设计；时尚设计\"},{\"phrase\":\"in fashion\",\"translation\":\"合于时尚，流行\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion show\",\"translation\":\"时装秀；时装表演会\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion accessories\",\"translation\":\"时尚饰品；流行配件\"},{\"phrase\":\"new fashion\",\"translation\":\"新时尚；新潮流\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion designer\",\"translation\":\"时装设计师\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion style\",\"translation\":\"时样，服装风格；流行款式\"},{\"phrase\":\"out of fashion\",\"translation\":\"过时的；不流行的\"},{\"phrase\":\"high fashion\",\"translation\":\"昂贵高雅的流行款式\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion model\",\"translation\":\"时装模特儿\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion color\",\"translation\":\"流行色\"},{\"phrase\":\"after a fashion\",\"translation\":\"adv. 勉强；不太好\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion from\",\"translation\":\"由…做成\"},{\"phrase\":\"old fashion\",\"translation\":\"老式样；古典；古老品系\"},{\"phrase\":\"in this fashion\",\"translation\":\"照这样\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion statement\",\"translation\":\"时尚宣言\"},{\"phrase\":\"fashion photography\",\"translation\":\"时装摄影；样式摄影术\"},{\"phrase\":\"in a fashion\",\"translation\":\"马马虎虎；勉强；多少还…一点\"},{\"phrase\":\"follow the fashion\",\"translation\":\"赶时髦，追随时尚\"},{\"phrase\":\"come into fashion\",\"translation\":\"流行；开始风行\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Young people are very concerned with fashion\",\"translation\":\"年轻人很关注时尚。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Hats like that just aren’t the fashion.\",\"translatio