ly half an inch high it flickered out and the room became dark.\",\"translation\":\"蜡烛只有半英寸长时，烛光忽闪忽闪地熄灭了，于是房间一片漆黑。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The candle flickered in the wind.\",\"translation\":\"烛光在风中闪烁不定。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The candle flickered and then went out.\",\"translation\":\"一开始蜡烛摇曳不定， 然后就灭了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The candle guttered out when the melted wax ran down its sides.\",\"translation\":\"熔化的蜡沿着蜡烛四周淌下，蜡烛就渐渐熄灭了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The candle flickered in the wind.\",\"translation\":\"烛光在风中闪烁不定。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The wind flared the candle.\",\"translation\":\"风吹得烛光闪动。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The candle flickered and then went out.\",\"translation\":\"一开始蜡烛摇曳不定， 然后就灭了。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"6a2f6bb1-5ef8-4b57-b43f-f6b1dca4b926\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"7a5f500e-f307-4f70-bff6-7ac85ed97208\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"82c2a5f9-2616-49c6-85dc-a4def021c610\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"f612d5da-a4ff-40d8-b95a-7136292608ba\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"25436176-13cc-4479-a6a1-24e4085a0e02\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"a2d70152-371b-4308-822c-8028d65c2490\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"fd760fa2-2aa3-40a4-ba49-739c5252f22b\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','蜡烛；烛光；烛形物；对着光检查','SYLLABUS',NULL),('61cd2fc2-58a9-4be3-bba9-d9fc5fdc1d09','due',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','junior','UK: /djuː /；US: /du /','[{\"phrase\":\"due for\",\"translation\":\"应该得到\"},{\"phrase\":\"due out\",\"translation\":\"待发；待退；应离店但还未离店\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"The team are due to fly to Italy next month.\",\"translation\":\"该球队预定下个月飞往意大利。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Any money due you will be sent by cheque through the post.\",\"translation\":\"应该支付给你的款项将会以支票邮寄给你。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"04654038-d1d8-452b-954f-fb0403d97867\",\"similarity_score\":0.6},{\"word_id\":\"2c0703fc-1049-4ac5-8515-0f94514f0fc0\",\"similarity_score\":0.4}]','[{\"word_id\":\"3fed4fc4-9949-46ba-810f-d6de285e1a9b\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"fc7c3edc-506e-459e-ba7d-59e80ca8c693\",\"edit_distance\":1},