49127','rooster',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'ruːstə /；US: /\'rustɚ /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"The cock (or rooster) bristled his crest.\",\"translation\":\"公鸡竖起了鸡冠。\"},{\"sentence\":\"On this day, the centipede out of play, did not expect close to cock it quietly, suddenly discovered the centipede rooster, rapid escape, but was too late.\",\"translation\":\"公鸡干着急。这一天，蜈蚣出来玩耍，没想到公鸡悄悄地接近了它，蜈蚣突然发现了公鸡，快速逃跑，可是已经来不及了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The cock (or rooster) bristled his crest.\",\"translation\":\"公鸡竖起了鸡冠。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'雄鸡，公鸡','SYLLABUS',NULL),('66154180-eb7a-4899-a678-e6981bcf54a7','fingernail',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'fɪŋgəneɪl /；US: /\'fɪŋɡɚnel /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"It takes about 150 days to grow out a full length fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"大约150天的时间就可以长一个完整的指甲出来。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The seal on the frosted bottle of Zubrowka was broken with a click—of plectrum on fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"齐白露加酒磨砂瓶上的封蜡咔哒一声被手指甲上的拔子启开。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Even those parents who seemed hard and demanding would just melt at the thought of their child in tears over a failed test or a broken fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"即使看上去强硬而又苛求的家长，一想到他们的子女因考试不及格或弄破了手指而掉眼泪的时候，也会立即融化。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It takes about 150 days to grow out a full length fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"大约150天的时间就可以长一个完整的指甲出来。\"},{\"sentence\":\"As I turned on my side I noticed pieces of fingernail, bits of skin and hair on the lift carpet.\",\"translation\":\"当我转身侧卧时，注意到电梯的地毯上有零星的指甲、皮肤碎屑和头发。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The top of the box was sealed with wide brown parcel tape, Jacob managed to get his fingernail under the end and peeled off the tape in one go.\",\"translation\":\"箱子的顶端是用褐色的包裹胶带封起来的，雅各布用指甲把胶带的一头抠起来，一下子把胶带整个扯开。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Guess how long is the longest fingernail in the world?\",\"translation\":\"请大家猜猜看世界上最长的手指甲到底有多长呢。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Humans encounter a lot of trouble when they are the size of a fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"当人类和手指甲一样大时，会遇到的麻烦可不少。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The Sydney funnel web is able to drive its fangs through a fingernail - and isn\'t the least bit afraid of humans.\",\"translation\":\"悉尼漏斗网蜘蛛可以把毒牙刺入人的指甲，关键是它们一点都不怕人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It takes about 150 days to grow out a full length fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"大约150天的时间就可以长一个完整的指甲出来。\"},{\"sentence\":\"As I turned on my side I noticed pieces of fingernail, bits of skin and hair on the lift carpet.\",\"translation\":\"当我转身侧卧时，注意到电梯的地毯上有零星的指甲、皮肤碎屑和头发。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The top of the box was sealed with wide brown parcel tape, Jacob managed to get his fingernail under the end and peeled off the tape in one go.\",\"translation\":\"箱子的顶端是用褐色的包裹胶带封起来的，雅各布用指甲把胶带的一头抠起来，一下子把胶带整个扯开。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It takes about 150 days to grow out a full length fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"大约150天的时间就可以长一个完整的指甲出来。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The seal on the frosted bottle of Zubrowka was broken with a click—of plectrum on fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"齐白露加酒磨砂瓶上的封蜡咔哒一声被手指甲上的拔子启开。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Even those parents who seemed hard and demanding would just melt at the thought of their child in tears over a failed test or a broken fingernail.\",\"translation\":\"即使看上去强硬而又苛求的家长，一想到他们的子女因考试不及格或弄破了手指而掉眼泪的时候，也会立即融化。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"547e1913-7976-43f0-976a-36f58717147c\",\"similarity_score\":0.5},{\"word_id\":\"c838474e-e86b-4bc7-9881-27dfdc95ed05\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"ee2430ef-1926-4fb2-b0c9-70a54bd14292\",\"similarity_score\":0.4}]',NULL,'手指甲','SYLLABUS',NULL),('6618aeae-532e-4c2b-8763-673c2ac28336','religious',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','senior','UK: /rɪ\'lɪdʒəs /；US: /rɪ\'lɪdʒəs /','[{\"phrase\":\"religious belief\",\"translation\":\"宗教信仰\"},{\"phrase\":\"religious culture\",\"translation\":\"宗教文化\"},{\"phrase\":\"religious education\",\"translation\":\"宗教教育\"},{\"phrase\":\"religious festival\",\"translation\":\"宗教节日\"},{\"phrase\":\"religious sect\",\"translation\":\"宗教派别\"},{\"phrase\":\"religious studies\",\"translation\":\"宗教研究\"},{\"phrase\":\"religious man\",\"translation\":\"虔诚的