orld, forests and the soil beneath them absorb about a quarter of all carbon emissions.\",\"translation\":\"纵观全球，森林与它们脚下的土壤能吸收大约碳排放总量的四分之一。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I dread to think what the carbon footprint must be like of moving that coal but we have no choice.\",\"translation\":\"我都不敢想象为了运这些煤产生了多少碳足迹，但我们没有选择。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"4386975e-bf61-4aca-b7c8-3f567c06d945\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"7674320e-94fd-463b-aebb-b2124f82528f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"14d37049-e932-4734-b549-50f0ffe26488\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"34d1d39f-495f-47fd-ac27-a9178bef3c21\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"9b2e86b4-d66d-49c3-a55a-ff998b8a4763\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"619bfb20-b797-4cc5-a774-f5004dbd9df1\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','[化学] 碳；碳棒；复写纸；碳的；碳处理的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('69cc3cdd-496a-44c4-993d-2daa51967e79','hungry',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','junior','UK: /\'hʌŋgrɪ /；US: /\'hʌŋɡri /','[{\"phrase\":\"hungry for\",\"translation\":\"渴望\"},{\"phrase\":\"go hungry\",\"translation\":\"挨饿\"},{\"phrase\":\"hungry for\",\"translation\":\"渴望\"},{\"phrase\":\"go hungry\",\"translation\":\"挨饿\"},{\"phrase\":\"hungry for\",\"translation\":\"渴望\"},{\"phrase\":\"go hungry\",\"translation\":\"挨饿\"},{\"phrase\":\"hungry for\",\"translation\":\"渴望\"},{\"phrase\":\"go hungry\",\"translation\":\"挨饿\"},{\"phrase\":\"hungry for\",\"translation\":\"渴望\"},{\"phrase\":\"go hungry\",\"translation\":\"挨饿\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"I was cold, tired, and hungry.\",\"translation\":\"我又冷，又累，又饿。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you get hungry , there’s some cold chicken in the fridge.\",\"translation\":\"你要是饿了，冰箱里有些冷鸡肉。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Do you still feel hungry?\",\"translation\":\"你还觉得饿吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I was cold, tired, and hungry.\",\"translation\":\"我又冷，又累，又饿。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you get hungry , there’s some cold chicken in the fridge.\",\"translation\":\"你要是饿了，冰箱里有些冷鸡肉。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Do you still feel hungry?\",\"translation\":\"你还觉得饿吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I was cold,