\"她默不作声地关上了门。 就在那时，她听到有声响。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I was paid £1,000, which was a lot of money back then (= a long time ago when things were different ) in the 1950s.\",\"translation\":\"他们给了我1,000英镑，在20世纪50年代那可是一大笔钱。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Mix the flour and butter, then add the eggs.\",\"translation\":\"把面粉和黄油和在一起，然后加入鸡蛋。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Byron travelled to Italy and then to Greece.\",\"translation\":\"拜伦先去意大利旅行，然后去了希腊。\"},{\"sentence\":\"This then was the situation facing the government at the end of the war.\",\"translation\":\"这就是战争结束时摆在政府面前的情况。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I wish I had known then what I know now.\",\"translation\":\"我真希望那时我就知道现在所知道的一切。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It was then that I realised she’d tricked me.\",\"translation\":\"直到那时我才知道她骗了我。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He started his career in St Petersburg – or Leningrad as it then was.\",\"translation\":\"他在圣彼得堡——当时叫列宁格勒——开始他的事业。\"},{\"sentence\":\"They met in 1942 and from then on (= starting at that time ) they were firm friends.\",\"translation\":\"他们1942年认识，从那时起就一直是好朋友。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Silently she closed the door. Just then she heard a noise.\",\"translation\":\"她默不作声地关上了门。 就在那时，她听到有声响。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I was paid £1,000, which was a lot of money back then (= a long time ago when things were different ) in the 1950s.\",\"translation\":\"他们给了我1,000英镑，在20世纪50年代那可是一大笔钱。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"9ff42100-3e3a-4aaa-bf84-08614fffd379\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"f27f417e-deea-47e1-9365-52ec81af348d\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"ad0c12fd-8322-41eb-b9d6-df7db4e3f2d4\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"cc1c8480-5165-457f-88af-a590cd08e50b\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"d2468779-c3dd-42aa-81a3-5fe2d772ff99\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"d47ba81c-655c-413a-ac39-4c0fce96b48e\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"da743b76-50de-4ae8-9553-72cdda17dd33\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"17fbae17-0e86-4b8a-8611-aeefb4ea6764\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','然后；那么；于是；当时；此外；那时；然后，当时','SYLLABUS',NULL),('6cd