slation\":\"突然，你手表上的可视电话响了。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"25febd41-54a8-45a7-8d51-326807401d46\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"23fc0071-4965-4b6d-bcbe-3409cf5aaab5\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"944499d0-cd09-42ee-a293-7cd37d8c70e3\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"b532cb48-055a-47be-a735-4dff2a19d230\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333}]',NULL,'可视电话','SYLLABUS',NULL),('797dd304-f109-421c-9076-70994bae0379','speak  English',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"f366a3e7-1347-4f0a-a8aa-b173aaf136bc\",\"edit_distance\":1}]','说英语','SYLLABUS',NULL),('798d1065-8f19-438c-8f65-1e9107090f1c','annoy',NULL,'VT','senior','UK: /ə\'nɒɪ /；US: /ə\'nɔɪ /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Try making a note of the things that annoy you.\",\"translation\":\"试着把让你心烦的事记下来。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It annoyed me that I didn\'t have time to do more ironing.\",\"translation\":\"没有时间熨更多的衣服让我心烦了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He is not doing this to annoy you.\",\"translation\":\"他做这件事并非是要惹你烦恼。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I am convinced that some people complain just to annoy me, for something to do, or they simply enjoy complaining.\",\"translation\":\"我以为身边的人抱怨是为了令我烦恼、是为了解决某些事、又或者他们就是喜欢抱怨。\"},{\"sentence\":\"What annoyed him most was that he had received no apology.\",\"translation\":\"最令他生气的是没人向他道歉。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It really annoys me when I see people dropping litter.\",\"translation\":\"看到别人乱丢垃圾我非常生气。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She annoyed him with her stupid questions.\",\"translation\":\"她那些愚蠢的问题令他很恼火。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He is not doing this to annoy you.\",\"translation\":\"他做这件事并非是要惹你烦恼。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I am convinced that some people complain just to annoy me, for something to do, or they simply enjoy complaining.\",\"translation\":\"我以为身边的人抱怨是为了令我烦恼、是为了解决某些事、又或者他们就是喜欢抱怨。\"},{\"sentence\":\"What annoyed him most was that he had received no apology.\",\"translation\":\"最令他生气的是没人向他道歉。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"ac0f22d7-6b86-4dee-a913-ca4a5798b90e\",\"s