 mom wasn’t looking.\",\"translation\":\"我们趁杰茜的妈妈没有看到，偷偷地溜了出去。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you look carefully you can see that the painting represents a human figure.\",\"translation\":\"如果仔细看，就会看出画上是一个人形。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Gina covered her eyes, afraid to look.\",\"translation\":\"吉娜捂住眼睛，不敢看。\"},{\"sentence\":\"From the way things look at the moment, the Republicans are unlikely to win this election.\",\"translation\":\"照目前的形势来看，本届大选共和党获胜无望。\"},{\"sentence\":\"You made me look really stupid in front of all my friends!\",\"translation\":\"你让我在所有朋友面前出尽了洋相！\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"92c58cd4-b948-4d1e-9e51-1c7a8ea3747d\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"98d0a48b-addf-4934-9158-47b0704bfbf0\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"b16066f4-8e14-4d63-b00e-d38739f961ff\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"d4a97850-15e2-4774-adcb-349f4444cfdc\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"f0bc70e0-305b-4625-9567-9d8e7b227de9\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"01750ec7-915a-46f3-bfa0-6fe7d0039e97\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"102d20c1-f74e-498f-a7d2-baf8033ca472\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"1e313f5f-b179-4d1f-bae3-60a75400ddb7\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','看；期待；注意；面向；看上去像；看；样子；面容','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7d3dd95f-8120-43ff-b878-db6dbd8c3037','Big Bang',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"We have a lot of energy in a small space, like you did at the Big Bang.\",\"translation\":\"的确，正如像宇宙大爆炸一样，我们在一个小空间里面有巨大的能量。\"},{\"sentence\":\"A \\\"quark-gluon plasma\\\" can be created if the collisions are energetic enough, a state of matter that existed during the high-energy conditions just after the Big Bang.\",\"translation\":\"如果对撞的能量足够大，就可能制造出一种“夸克——胶子等离子体”，这是在宇宙大爆炸之后的高能环境下存在的一种物质状态。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'宇宙大爆炸；创世大爆炸','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7d421c7f-e23e-4e4f-ad99-7fc2d037d63c','fire',NULL,'NOUN/VERB','junior','UK: /\'faɪə /；US: /faɪr /','[{\"phrase\":\"on fire\",\"translation\":\"adv. 着火；起火；在兴头上；非常激动\"},{\"phrase\":\"on the fire\",\"translation\":\"在审议中；在考虑中\"},{\"phrase\":\"fire con