-4401-a13c-1594e0bc478c\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"211b8441-bbdf-47d5-98b6-90a313514279\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"7acca8bd-1e3c-475e-823c-933e06da6d51\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','运转；发挥作用','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7efcfde0-0ad4-475c-8202-95ccb6de0215','rely on',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Therefore, we are not to rely on feelings, but to have faith in the facts.\",\"translation\":\"因此，我们不能依靠我们的感觉，而是要将信心建立在事实上。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But what of the resources we rely on to sustain and develop our technology?\",\"translation\":\"但是我们依靠什么资源来支持和发展我们的科技？\"},{\"sentence\":\"However, many objects rely on other objects or layers of infrastructure.\",\"translation\":\"然而，许多对象依赖基础结构的其它对象或层。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Therefore, we are not to rely on feelings, but to have faith in the facts.\",\"translation\":\"因此，我们不能依靠我们的感觉，而是要将信心建立在事实上。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But what of the resources we rely on to sustain and develop our technology?\",\"translation\":\"但是我们依靠什么资源来支持和发展我们的科技？\"},{\"sentence\":\"However, many objects rely on other objects or layers of infrastructure.\",\"translation\":\"然而，许多对象依赖基础结构的其它对象或层。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Many people now rely on the Internet for news.\",\"translation\":\"很多人现在靠因特网来了解新闻。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'依赖，依靠','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7f0f8b5a-8424-4530-9b90-ea7a1c616366','anti-black',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','senior','UK: /,æntɪ\'blæk /；US: /,ænti\'blæk /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Later, believing all mankind to be equal, he devoted himself to stopping the unfair anti-black laws.\",\"translation\":\"后来，因为相信所有人类都是生来平等，他全身心投入到废除不平等的反黑人法律工作中。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"1cbf223e-1906-4275-8461-d63c48fa3f0a\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"54e5c0b7-087f-468b-8e7f-1f25125f064b\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"686403ec-9973-46c3-a6c9-11706c7ef5c0\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"8aa793fa-2911-4669-9ac5-5fa40d1d0f15\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"96203a1e-1417-4b98-ad11-31fd4a15c0b0\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"ac