sentence\":\"The country was in a state of war (= officially fighting a war ) .\",\"translation\":\"这个国家正处于战争状态。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Water exists in three states: liquid, gaseous, and solid.\",\"translation\":\"水有三种形态: 液态、气态和固态。\"},{\"sentence\":\"...reform of the state social-security system.\",\"translation\":\"…国家社会保障体制的改革。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Please state your name and address.\",\"translation\":\"请说出你的姓名和地址。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Rembert again stated his intention to resign from Parliament.\",\"translation\":\"兰伯特再次表明辞去议员职务的意向。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The government needs to clearly state its policy on UN intervention.\",\"translation\":\"政府需要就联合国的干预清楚地阐明其政策。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Fine, but aren’t you just stating the obvious here?\",\"translation\":\"没错，可你说的谁不知道呢？\"},{\"sentence\":\"She was in an extremely confused state of mind .\",\"translation\":\"她思绪纷乱。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She can’t go home now. Look at the state of her!\",\"translation\":\"她现在不能回家。看看她这副样子！\"},{\"sentence\":\"The country was in a state of war (= officially fighting a war ) .\",\"translation\":\"这个国家正处于战争状态。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Water exists in three states: liquid, gaseous, and solid.\",\"translation\":\"水有三种形态: 液态、气态和固态。\"},{\"sentence\":\"...reform of the state social-security system.\",\"translation\":\"…国家社会保障体制的改革。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Queensland is one of the states of Australia.\",\"translation\":\"昆士兰是澳大利亚的一个州。\"},{\"sentence\":\"the state of Iowa\",\"translation\":\"艾奥瓦州\"},{\"sentence\":\"state and federal taxes\",\"translation\":\"州政府和联邦政府征收的税\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2efda146-6e09-43ed-bd5e-594d6c06969c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"82705c49-3f7c-440a-bc52-7fbad95ccb89\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"99e5140b-d776-4d92-a55d-16a1d8a4e375\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"82cc1072-0fdc-4018-b48a-6a50427ab116\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"31730807-2a29-40f3-8dea-f7745bb6582b\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"3f4277ac-1f5c-4f6c-ad20-fb2de8de5fce\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"45e35910-935f-492c-a4b0-727c39f56d50\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"5a079578-cc19-4338-ac10-026bcb4dcd35\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','国家；州；情形；规定；声明；陈述；国家的；州的；正式的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7f9ec737-c93f-453b-8fde-e418f0e2850b','holographic',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','senior','UK: /,hɒlə\'ɡræfɪk /；US: /,hɑlə\'ɡræfɪk /','[{\"phrase\":\"holographic interferometry\",\"translation\":\"全息干涉量度学\"},{\"phrase\":\"holographic grating\",\"translation\":\"[化]全息照相栅\"},{\"phrase\":\"holographic technique\",\"translation\":\"全息摄影技术\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"When Hogan first realised this, he wondered if any experiment might be able to detect the holographic blurriness of space-time.\",\"translation\":\"当霍根第一次意识到这一点时，他急欲知道是否有实验能够探测时空的全息模糊度。\"},{\"sentence\":\"No one knows what it would mean for us if we really do live in a hologram, yet theorists have good reasons to believe that many aspects of the holographic principle are true.\",\"translation\":\"如果我们确实生活在一张全息图中，没人知道这对我们究竟意味着什么。 但理论学家有很好的理由相信全息原理的很多方面是真实的。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"54e5c0b7-087f-468b-8e7f-1f25125f064b\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"a3ec4df2-f8c5-4f41-88c0-74914dc7a54d\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333}]',NULL,'全息照相的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7fad8d48-aa60-4f1d-bfbb-7ae4ca0713da','seedling',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'siːdlɪŋ /；US: /\'sidlɪŋ /','[{\"phrase\":\"seedling stage\",\"translation\":\"苗期\"},{\"phrase\":\"seedling nursery\",\"translation\":\"苗圃；播种苗圃\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"The two species effectively team up to break down young rice plants for their nutrients, causing a plant disease known as rice seedling blight.\",\"translation\":\"这两个物种结合起来，能有效地分解水稻的幼苗作为它们的营养来源，并造成水稻幼苗的枯萎。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But Violet Vale was purple with violets and the seedling apple tree Gilbert had once found far back in the woods was a huge tree peppered over with tiny, crimson-tipped blossom-buds.\",\"translation\":\"但紫罗兰山谷仍开满了紫色的花朵，而吉尔伯特发现的那树林背后的苹果树苗如今也已经长成了绽满了细小花苞的大树。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Physically separating the weed from the other plants, the researchers placed the dodder seedling in the middle of two plastic pipes, each leading to a plastic box containing a plant.\",\"translation\":\"研究人员将菟丝子秧苗放到两个塑料圆筒中间，两个圆筒分别通向一个塑料盒子，盒子里各放着一种植物。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"8b42f4c8-282c-4f07-b0d5-64bb4a353cc3\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','秧苗；树苗','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7fbf93ff-b5e7-41e2-b647-ef99866847c3','weekend',NULL,'','primary','UK: /wiːkˈɛnd /；US: /ˈwikend /','[{\"phrase\":\"last weekend\",\"translation\":\"上周末\"},{\"phrase\":\"at the weekend\",\"translation\":\"在周末\"},{\"phrase\":\"over the weekend\",\"translation\":\"在周末；整个周末；经过周末\"},{\"phrase\":\"on the weekend\",\"translation\":\"在周末\"},{\"phrase\":\"on weekend\",\"translation\":\"在周末\"},{\"phrase\":\"at weekend\",\"translation\":\"在周末\"},{\"phrase\":\"have a nice weekend\",\"translation\":\"周末玩得愉快\"},{\"phrase\":\"have a good weekend\",\"translation\":\"周末愉快\"},{\"phrase\":\"weekend party\",\"translation\":\"周末派对\"},{\"phrase\":\"weekend activities\",\"translation\":\"周末活动\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Are you doing anything nice this weekend?\",\"translation\":\"这个周末你有什么好的安排？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Tony has been unwell over the weekend (= during the weekend ).\",\"translation\":\"托尼这个周末身体不舒服。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We’re going to Paris for a long weekend (= Saturday and Sunday, and also Friday or Monday, or both ).\",\"translation\":\"我们要到巴黎去度一个长周末。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"0a994a3e-ade0-4e25-8ad4-ab4df3d4f31b\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','周末','SYLLABUS',NULL),('7fcc9b4f-30df-408f-92fe-7b86651a1cd0','container',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /kən\'teɪnə /；US: /kən\'tenɚ /','[{\"phrase\":\"container transport\",\"translation\":\"集装箱运输\"},{\"phrase\":\"container terminal\",\"translation\":\"集装箱码头；货柜码头\"},{\"phrase\":\"container ship\",\"translation\":\"集装箱运货船；货柜船\"},{\"phrase\":\"container port\",\"translation\":\"n. 货柜港口\"},{\"phrase\":\"pressure container\",\"translation\":\"压力容器，耐压容器；喷涂压料罐\"},{\"phrase\":\"container crane\",\"translation\":