,{\"phrase\":\"unexpected accident\",\"translation\":\"不能预料的事故\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"I met her quite by accident (=  completely by accident  ) .\",\"translation\":\"我遇见她完全是偶然。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The discovery was made almost by accident.\",\"translation\":\"这项发现几乎纯属意外。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The pilot, whether by accident or design (=  whether it was planned or not planned  ) , made the plane do a sharp turn.\",\"translation\":\"不知是有意还是无意，那名飞行员让飞机来了个急转弯。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Ken had an accident at work and had to go to hospital.\",\"translation\":\"肯在工作中出了事故，不得不去医院。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I’m sorry about breaking the vase – it was an accident (=  I did not intend to do it  ) .\",\"translation\":\"对不起，我把花瓶打碎了——这是个意外。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She was injured in a freak accident (=  an unusual accident  ) when a wall suddenly collapsed.\",\"translation\":\"她在一场墙壁突然倒塌的诡异事故中受了伤。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I had a slight accident with your coffee.\",\"translation\":\"出了个小小的意外，我把你的咖啡弄洒了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"They lost their lives in a tragic accident .\",\"translation\":\"他们在一次悲惨的事故中丧生。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I met her quite by accident (=  completely by accident  ) .\",\"translation\":\"我遇见她完全是偶然。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The discovery was made almost by accident.\",\"translation\":\"这项发现几乎纯属意外。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The pilot, whether by accident or design (=  whether it was planned or not planned  ) , made the plane do a sharp turn.\",\"translation\":\"不知是有意还是无意，那名飞行员让飞机来了个急转弯。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Ken had an accident at work and had to go to hospital.\",\"translation\":\"肯在工作中出了事故，不得不去医院\"},{\"sentence\":\"Over 70,000 people are seriously injured every year in road accidents.\",\"translation\":\"每年在道路事故中受重伤的有七万多人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The accident happened at the junction of Forest Road and Pine Walk.\",\"translation\":\"事故发生在森林路与松树路的交叉口。\"},{\"sentence\":\"a train accident\",\"translation\":\"火车事故\"},{\"sentence\":\"Over 70,000 people are seriously injured every year in road accidents.\",\"translation\":\"每年在道路事故中受重伤的有七万多人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The accident happened at the junction of Forest Road and Pine Walk.\",\"translation\":\"事故发生在森林路与松树路的交叉口。\"},{\"sentence\":\"a train accident\",\"translation\":\"火车事故\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2c8b3402-e7ac-40ed-81be-844dda61aee6\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"f88d789c-d63d-469d-9985-eedf3665cde8\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','事故；意外；[法] 意外事件；机遇','SYLLABUS',NULL);
