{\"phrase\":\"tin dioxide\",\"translation\":\"[化]二氧化锡\"},{\"phrase\":\"vanadium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化钒\"},{\"phrase\":\"cerium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化铈\"},{\"phrase\":\"carbon dioxide ice\",\"translation\":\"干冰，固体二氧化碳\"},{\"phrase\":\"tellurium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化碲\"},{\"phrase\":\"carbon dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化碳\"},{\"phrase\":\"titanium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化钛\"},{\"phrase\":\"sulfur dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化硫\"},{\"phrase\":\"chlorine dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化碳\"},{\"phrase\":\"silicon dioxide\",\"translation\":\"[化]二氧化硅\"},{\"phrase\":\"sulphur dioxide\",\"translation\":\"[化]二氧化硫\"},{\"phrase\":\"manganese dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化锰\"},{\"phrase\":\"lead dioxide\",\"translation\":\"[化]二氧化铅\"},{\"phrase\":\"liquid carbon dioxide\",\"translation\":\"液态二氧化碳\"},{\"phrase\":\"nitrogen dioxide\",\"translation\":\"[化]二氧化氮\"},{\"phrase\":\"zirconium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化锆\"},{\"phrase\":\"carbon dioxide laser\",\"translation\":\"二氧化碳激光器；二氧化碳雷射\"},{\"phrase\":\"tin dioxide\",\"translation\":\"[化]二氧化锡\"},{\"phrase\":\"vanadium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化钒\"},{\"phrase\":\"cerium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化铈\"},{\"phrase\":\"carbon dioxide ice\",\"translation\":\"干冰，固体二氧化碳\"},{\"phrase\":\"tellurium dioxide\",\"translation\":\"二氧化碲\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"How much carbon dioxide you save, if any, depends on how far you live from work and how you get there, among other things.\",\"translation\":\"如果真有的话，你可以节约多少二氧化碳？ 它取决于你住得有多远还是你如何完成目标抑或其他因素？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Studying the light in each image could also reveal physical characteristics, such as the presence of water or carbon dioxide.\",\"translation\":\"研究每个行星图像中的光线同样可以揭示物理特性，如是否存在水或二氧化碳。\"},{\"sentence\":\"And then we have gas cooled reactors which can use supercritical carbon dioxide or helium.\",\"translation\":\"然后我们有气体冷却反应堆,那能使用超临界二氧化碳或者氦。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She is your indispensable oxygen, carbon dioxide is not essential you me.\",\"translation\":\"她是你不可缺少的氧气，我是你可有可无的二氧化碳。\"},{\"sentence\":\"This all has to do with photosynthesis, the process in which plants turn sunlight, carbon dioxide and water into food.\",\"translation\":\"这一切都与光合作用有关，在这一过程中，植物将阳光、二氧化碳和水转变为食物。\"},{\"sentence\":\"What was happening was this: in its pure state of repeating units of one titanium and two oxygen atoms, titanium dioxide is a semiconductor.\",\"translation\":\"发生的事是这样的：在纯净的一个钛和两个氧原子组成的重复单位下，二氧化钛是一种半导体。\"},{\"sentence\":\"How much carbon dioxide you save, if any, depends on how far you live from work and how you get there, among other things.\",\"translation\":\"如果真有的话，你可以节约多少二氧化碳？ 它取决于你住得有多远还是你如何完成目标抑或其他因素？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Studying the light in each image could also reveal physical characteristics, such as the presence of water or carbon dioxide.\",\"translation\":\"研究每个行星图像中的光线同样可以揭示物理特性，如是否存在水或二氧化碳。\"},{\"sentence\":\"And then we have gas cooled reactors which can use supercritical carbon dioxide or helium.\",\"translation\":\"然后我们有气体冷却反应堆,那能使用超临界二氧化碳或者氦。\"},{\"sentence\":\"How much carbon dioxide you save, if any, depends on how far you live from work and how you get there, among other things.\",\"translation\":\"如果真有的话，你可以节约多少二氧化碳？ 它取决于你住得有多远还是你如何完成目标抑或其他因素？\"},{\"sentence\":\"And then we have gas cooled reactors which can use supercritical carbon dioxide or helium.\",\"translation\":\"然后我们有气体冷却反应堆,那能使用超临界二氧化碳或者氦。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But as Solomon and colleagues suggest in a new study published in the Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, it is not true for the most abundant greenhouse gas: carbon dioxide.\",\"translation\":\"但是，正如所罗门和他的同事提出的一项发表在《美国国家科学院院刊》的新研究表明，对最丰富的温室气体，二氧化碳，这是不正确的。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"2921d2dd-5c07-44b0-b8cf-676846f6ebf0\",\"similarity_score\":0.6},{\"word_id\":\"5384e30e-fcc7-4242-951d-ad572e1ab536\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"7a53b2f0-320a-4a71-bfaa-06f7a51ec532\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"fbaa1ece-e55f-46f2-a0bc-90714a1ae444\",