6f2426f1d9\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','软的，柔软的；温柔的，温和的；软弱的；笨的；柔软地；温和地；柔性；柔软的东西；柔软部分','SYLLABUS',NULL),('8b370b07-32fb-4623-9fbe-ca85511ce4e6','the day after tomorrow',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Begin the job the day after tomorrow.\",\"translation\":\"后天开始干这活吧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She says the demolition could be today, tomorrow, or the day after tomorrow. She does not know.\",\"translation\":\"她说，拆除行动可能就在今天、明天或者后天，具体日期她无法得知。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'后天','SYLLABUS',NULL),('8b3950e9-5a4b-4208-b38d-ad982e2401ab','air conditioner',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"The air conditioner was just what the Brooklyn printer needed.\",\"translation\":\"这种空调设备正好是布鲁克林印刷机所需要的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"There’s no denying, though, that a good air conditioner can beat the heat.\",\"translation\":\"可是，不可否认的是，好的空调设备可以抵御炎热。\"},{\"sentence\":\"However, for a while the land around the city acted as a natural air conditioner, keeping the air cool through evaporation of moisture from the ground.\",\"translation\":\"不过，有一段时间，莫斯科市周围的土地起到了自然空调的作用，通过从地面蒸发湿气保持空气凉爽。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'空调','SYLLABUS',NULL),('8b42f4c8-282c-4f07-b0d5-64bb4a353cc3','spelling',NULL,'NOUN','junior','UK: /\'spelɪŋ /；US: /\'spɛlɪŋ /','[{\"phrase\":\"spelling bee\",\"translation\":\"拼字比赛会\"},{\"phrase\":\"spelling mistake\",\"translation\":\"拼写错误\"},{\"phrase\":\"spelling checker\",\"translation\":\"[计]拼写检查程序\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Her spelling has improved.\",\"translation\":\"她的拼写进步了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"an essay full of spelling mistakes\",\"translation\":\"一篇满是拼写错误的文章\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"7fad8d48-aa60-4f1d-bfbb-7ae4ca0713da\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"9b309fbf-9c20-4471-a112-c0ec2bbe6bee\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"ff269266-f083-47f0-9408-f03fb62d8691\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','拼写','SYLLABUS',NULL),('8b47e7b0-509b-4df0-8da7-0b8bd6ad45ca','tape player',NULL,'NOUN','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"We put a tape player, then a computer, on their desks.\",\"translation\":\"我们只在他们的书桌上放上一个收音机