\",\"translation\":\"灌溉系统，浇灌系统\"},{\"phrase\":\"irrigation equipment\",\"translation\":\"灌溉设备\"},{\"phrase\":\"furrow irrigation\",\"translation\":\"沟灌，畦灌；畦沟灌溉\"},{\"phrase\":\"border irrigation\",\"translation\":\"畦灌；带状灌溉\"},{\"phrase\":\"spray irrigation\",\"translation\":\"喷水灌溉；喷洒灌溉法\"},{\"phrase\":\"irrigation canal\",\"translation\":\"灌溉渠，浇灌渠\"},{\"phrase\":\"surface irrigation\",\"translation\":\"地面灌溉；地面浇灌\"},{\"phrase\":\"irrigation ditch\",\"translation\":\"灌溉水渠；农渠\"},{\"phrase\":\"flood irrigation\",\"translation\":\"淹灌；漫灌\"},{\"phrase\":\"irrigation channel\",\"translation\":\"灌溉渠，灌渠；进水渠道\"},{\"phrase\":\"drop irrigation\",\"translation\":\"点滴灌溉\"},{\"phrase\":\"irrigation network\",\"translation\":\"灌溉网\"},{\"phrase\":\"trickle irrigation\",\"translation\":\"滴灌；滴灌系统\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Rivers and lakes provide us with water transport and irrigation.\",\"translation\":\"江河湖泽给我们以舟楫和灌溉之利。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In the United States, by contrast, 41% goes for agriculture, almost all of it for irrigation.\",\"translation\":\"与之相比，美国全年41%的水投向了农业，并几乎全都用在了灌溉上。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Small blockages or collapses of the canal would choke the intricate irrigation networks.\",\"translation\":\"运河的小堵塞或倒塌都会阻塞整个负责的灌溉网络。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In the United States, by contrast, 41% goes for agriculture, almost all of it for irrigation.\",\"translation\":\"与之相比，美国全年41%的水投向了农业，并几乎全都用在了灌溉上。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Spray irrigation sprinkling water over land to be used for crops. often used to dispose of wastewater from sewage treatment plants.\",\"translation\":\"喷洒灌溉，喷灌把水喷洒于准备种植作物的土地上。常常使用经过污水厂处理过的废水。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Rivers and lakes provide us with water transport and irrigation.\",\"translation\":\"江河湖泽给我们以舟楫和灌溉之利。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'灌溉','SYLLABUS',NULL),('8d980e80-e1b5-45c8-9c10-0c6530d598da','tolerance',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'tɒl(ə)r(ə)ns /；US: /\'tɑlərəns /','[{\"phrase\":\"fault tolerance\",\"translation\":\"容错，故障容差\"},{\"phrase\":\"glucose tolerance\",\"translation\":\"葡萄糖耐