e\":\"She muffled her throat with a scarf.\",\"translation\":\"她用围巾围住脖子。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"b9ca5e39-caa1-455d-806c-da9fb86285e8\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"c1c2a3fb-b501-49d6-9be0-51faacb76e2c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"dd332b73-dcc3-44f8-b813-2b0368005ece\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"1907a6ac-2961-41a2-9b6b-e8bfc0a5ea9f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"61ab338c-c34a-4497-9aed-a816b537bc1f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"86fec0cf-1b5f-42fd-a00b-a9d7a34b001a\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"af7ee9c2-08f3-4bb4-a1d7-681e128ad8db\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"c21017ef-db8a-4fd4-aed8-45566129b692\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','围巾','SYLLABUS',NULL),('91696102-63ce-4b22-a479-cf12139053db','dialect',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'daɪəlekt /；US: /\'daɪə\'lɛkt /','[{\"phrase\":\"chinese dialect\",\"translation\":\"中国方言\"},{\"phrase\":\"local dialect\",\"translation\":\"地区方言\"},{\"phrase\":\"chinese dialect\",\"translation\":\"中国方言\"},{\"phrase\":\"local dialect\",\"translation\":\"地区方言\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"the local dialect\",\"translation\":\"当地方言\"},{\"sentence\":\"the local dialect\",\"translation\":\"当地方言\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"39fedb0d-5e51-49a7-9cfc-22b1851f8aa5\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"fdafb16c-7430-4565-a3a4-a8d9d1f565d8\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333}]','[{\"word_id\":\"a7273c3b-91cd-4cf3-979e-ffd64dbded13\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','方言，土语','SYLLABUS',NULL),('9176bb6e-ef30-46d9-925a-e56524be4ff8','light bulb',NULL,'NOUN','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"By far his favourite invention was the record player. His other famous invention was the light bulb.\",\"translation\":\"他最中意的发明是录音机，他另一个著名的发明是电灯泡。\"},{\"sentence\":\"When you suddenly you see a bright light like the sun or a light bulb then you feel like you are going to sneeze.\",\"translation\":\"当你突然看到类似于太阳 或者电灯泡所发出的一束强光时， 你会觉得好像有种打喷嚏的冲动。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In this way the light bulb requests an address block from the light switch, the light switch in turn from the electrical system which in turn requests one from the room/floor controller.\",\"translation\":\"依照这种方式, 电灯泡会向电灯开关申请一个地址段, 而电灯开关则会向其上级的电力系统转交申请, 电力系统则将申请转交给该房间/该层的控制器.\"}]',NULL,NULL,'电灯泡','SYLLABUS',NULL);
