朋友”开始的，并且多数是同事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The link between a positive workmate relationship and the risk of mortality was most notable among those aged between 38 and 43.\",\"translation\":\"与同事建立积极关系和死亡风险之间的联系在38到43岁人群当中最为显著。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The report found more than a fifth of employees have recently confided in a colleague, while a similar number said they would turn to a workmate first.\",\"translation\":\"研究报告指出，超过五分之一的员工最近曾向一位同事倾吐秘密，另外有同样数量的人说他们会最先向同事倾诉。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"0dcd8a4e-9286-49ac-b058-596d7639ccf3\",\"similarity_score\":0.4},{\"word_id\":\"7db5c286-d60e-46cf-abe7-0427b2f2d1ef\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333}]',NULL,'同事；工友','SYLLABUS',NULL),('95e755da-48f0-4345-b18f-73bdb90e9438','Futuroscope',NULL,'NOUN','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Futuroscope is not only for individuals, but is also the perfect mix of fun and learning for class outings.\",\"translation\":\"“观测未来”主题公园不仅适合个人，也适合学生全班出游，因为它是娱乐与学习的完美结合。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"16339fd2-a1c8-4c2f-8db2-8f8d5a2a198b\",\"similarity_score\":0.4}]',NULL,'观测未来（公园名，位于法国）','SYLLABUS',NULL),('95ec66d3-893d-41ed-9a59-0bd190882d8a','legal',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','senior','UK: /\'liːg(ə)l /；US: /\'ligl /','[{\"phrase\":\"legal system\",\"translation\":\"法律制度\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal status\",\"translation\":\"法律地位\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal protection\",\"translation\":\"法律保护；合法保护\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal services\",\"translation\":\"法律服务\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal responsibility\",\"translation\":\"法律责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal aid\",\"translation\":\"法律援助\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal liability\",\"translation\":\"法律责任\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal action\",\"translation\":\"法律诉讼\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal right\",\"translation\":\"合法权利，法定权利\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal entity\",\"translation\":\"法人实体\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal effect\",\"translation\":\"法律效力\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal representative\",\"translation\":\"n. 法定代理人\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal documents\",\"translation\":\"法律文件；法定单证（legal document的复数）\"},{\"phrase\":\"legal advice\",\"transl