\":\"史蒂夫借来他爸爸的跑车向女友炫耀。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘He’s a lawyer?’ Mum looked suitably impressed (= as impressed as you would expect ).\",\"translation\":\"“他是个律师？”妈妈看上去果然对他印象颇好。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'给…深刻印象， 使铭记','SYLLABUS',NULL),('a8cf779c-5ab1-4a79-992e-ba22358aa0cf','Darlene Coulon',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"When Darlene Coulon from France came dashing through the door, she recognized Tony Garcia\'s smiling face.\",\"translation\":\"当来自法国的达琳•库隆匆忙走进门的时候，她认出了托尼•加西亚微笑的面孔。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'达琳•库隆','SYLLABUS',NULL),('a8d1db34-8440-49a2-8563-49174e2da34e','pick apples',NULL,'','primary','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"We helped the farmers to pick apples.\",\"translation\":\"我们帮助农民们摘苹果。\"},{\"sentence\":\"People like to go to farms in the countryside and pick apples.\",\"translation\":\"人们喜欢去郊区的农场摘苹果。\"},{\"sentence\":\"As an adult, I do my best to take my 9- and 7-year-old nieces every year on the same hay rides through the apple orchards I visited to pick apples when I was their age.\",\"translation\":\"成年之后，我每年都会尽量带上自己9岁和7岁的侄子开车经过一片苹果园，在他们这个年纪的时候，我曾在这里参观过并摘过苹果。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'摘苹果','SYLLABUS',NULL),('a8dfbfa9-87ab-4c8f-b01c-19f8e5f6a138','coincidence',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /kəʊ\'ɪnsɪd(ə)ns /；US: /ko\'ɪnsɪdəns /','[{\"phrase\":\"coincidence rate\",\"translation\":\"符合率；符合计数率\"},{\"phrase\":\"by coincidence\",\"translation\":\"碰巧\"},{\"phrase\":\"coincidence rate\",\"translation\":\"符合率；符合计数率\"},{\"phrase\":\"by coincidence\",\"translation\":\"碰巧\"},{\"phrase\":\"coincidence rate\",\"translation\":\"符合率；符合计数率\"},{\"phrase\":\"by coincidence\",\"translation\":\"碰巧\"},{\"phrase\":\"coincidence rate\",\"translation\":\"符合率；符合计数率\"},{\"phrase\":\"by coincidence\",\"translation\":\"碰巧\"},{\"phrase\":\"coincidence rate\",\"translation\":\"符合率；符合计数率\"},{\"phrase\":\"by coincidence\",\"translation\":\"碰巧\"},{\"phrase\":\"coincidence rate\",\"translation\":\"符合率；符合计数率\"},{\"phrase\":\"by coincidence\",\"translation\":\"碰巧\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"‘I’m going to Appleby tomorrow.’