rs\",\"translation\":\"希望让顾客满意的一家公司\"},{\"sentence\":\"She did everything she could to please him.\",\"translation\":\"她千方百计讨好他。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Most children are eager to please .\",\"translation\":\"大多数孩子都渴望取悦别人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"a business that wants to please its customers\",\"translation\":\"希望让顾客满意的一家公司\"},{\"sentence\":\"She did everything she could to please him.\",\"translation\":\"她千方百计讨好他。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Most children are eager to please .\",\"translation\":\"大多数孩子都渴望取悦别人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"a business that wants to please its customers\",\"translation\":\"希望让顾客满意的一家公司\"},{\"sentence\":\"She did everything she could to please him.\",\"translation\":\"她千方百计讨好他。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Most children are eager to please .\",\"translation\":\"大多数孩子都渴望取悦别人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Could you please clean up the living room?\",\"translation\":\"你把起居室打扫一下好吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Sit down, please.\",\"translation\":\"请坐。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Please be quiet!\",\"translation\":\"请安静！\"},{\"sentence\":\"Could you please clean up the living room?\",\"translation\":\"你把起居室打扫一下好吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Sit down, please.\",\"translation\":\"请坐。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Please be quiet!\",\"translation\":\"请安静！\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"15f37bc8-023b-4b62-a375-9c2fc1f9b7e0\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"38dfd2c6-6bbf-4a71-aa35-e6f51907c544\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"14e48647-6604-44e6-9396-c935c1c34d7e\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"3d6abefe-20e1-49dc-b323-cfa6ab99d1ef\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"66379256-3f30-44b7-a0ee-5cb94bcc5e99\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"d5ea0385-3a2a-42f7-834a-f2243b0a01bc\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"e30c5d91-48aa-4cb6-b8ca-7c6f9c202dc8\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"40ce8917-c00a-4db0-99e0-04fc95ad1a5b\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','使喜欢；使高兴，使满意；请（礼貌用语）','SYLLABUS',NULL),('b0362f69-a2ba-4461-9b1c-f0030c98aacf','the World Wireless Forum',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'世界无线电话论坛','SYLLABUS',NULL),('b03f257b-1ba0-438e-9fd1-8df707a54117','fry',NULL,'VERB','junior','UK: /fraɪ /；US: /fraɪ /','[{\"phrase\":\"stir fry\",\"translation\":\"用大火炒；快炒\"},{\"phrase\":\"deep fry\",\"translation\":\"油炸\"},{\"phrase\":\"small fry\",\"translation\":\"无足轻重的人；不重要的\"},{\"phrase\":\"fish fry\",\"translation\":\"鱼苗；炸鱼\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Fry the potatoes, covered, for about 20 minutes.\",\"translation\":\"盖上盖，将马铃薯煎20分钟左右。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I could smell onions frying.\",\"translation\":\"我闻到了煎洋葱的味道。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"d7005f28-cbf5-4914-875a-c78a2b64e39b\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"016a00aa-3dbf-4718-8c77-c939caa773b0\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"01822cd9-6556-4222-bfa1-8e1d95db02e5\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"16c0943d-0340-4dcf-8320-5545ed90a57d\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"28647127-71e1-4895-8af3-6f54c51fa50a\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"2bf04d37-dbf2-4c3e-804a-575c6a86cfac\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"4005d23b-26e0-4b86-b389-24378141b975\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"5d422a5f-ebdb-47a9-a9ec-5845ac08a217\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','油煎， 油炸','SYLLABUS',NULL),('b04207f3-503b-473f-94d2-f72f5a1941b6','ice cream',NULL,'','primary','UK: /aɪs kri:m /；US: /aɪs krim /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"I like ice cream and cookies as much as the next guy. But I hate how it makes me feel afterward.\",\"translation\":\"我喜欢冰淇淋和曲奇，但我又讨厌吃完之后所带给我的感受，疲倦，瞌睡，精力不集中等等。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you enjoy chocolate ice cream, as I do, when confronted with a tub of it would you also enjoy eating as much of the tub as possible?\",\"translation\":\"如果你像我一样喜欢吃巧克力冰淇淋，那么当你面前放着一桶这样的冰淇淋时，你是否会敞开肚子尽量多吃呢？\"},{\"sentence\":\"On the morning of the stroke, I woke up to a pounding pain behind my left eye. And it was the kind of pain, caustic pain, that you get when you bite into ice cream.\",\"translation\":\"那 天早上，我从睡梦中醒来，发现自己的左脑疼痛不止，那种痛楚跟你咬冰淇淋的那种腐蚀性的感觉一样，它抓住我，然后又放开，然后再次抓住，再次放开。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"47076113-7f05-4eb8-b578-d06235f657cf\",\"edit_dist