 /\'slɪŋʃɒt /；US: /\'slɪŋʃɑt /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"He came at Goliath with a slingshot and staff because those were the tools of his trade.\",\"translation\":\"他用以攻击歌利亚的武器是一个弹弓和一把竹杖，因为这就是他牧羊用的工具。\"},{\"sentence\":\"With big 80s hair, the neon shades and the slingshot, she’s probably the most \\\"punk rock\\\" of this bunch.\",\"translation\":\"有着大大的80后的发型，氖阴影和弹弓，她或许这群人中最有朋克风格的一任。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The valley of Elah is where the Philistines sent out their Goliath to terrify the Israelites, and where young David felled the giant with his trusty slingshot.\",\"translation\":\"以拉谷地是古腓力斯国派出他们的英雄歌力亚恐吓以色列人的地方，在这里，年轻的大卫王用自己可靠的弹弓击倒了巨人歌力亚。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"38cfed3b-0505-4fc8-a769-80f607627a9a\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"4587d7eb-6343-486d-aa1b-0513ead8abeb\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"cfbd0f63-90b4-4b6f-b394-1f8f631306d1\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333}]',NULL,'弹弓','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bb7bdbd9-9951-4edd-a841-f78a5818a1df','helpful',NULL,'','primary','UK: /\'helpfʊl; -f(ə)l /；US: /\'hɛlpfl /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Thank you for your advice; it’s been very helpful.\",\"translation\":\"谢谢你的建议，它非常有用。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It is helpful if we address a few key questions here.\",\"translation\":\"如果我们在这里解决一些关键问题会很有用的。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'有用的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bb81933d-36cf-4794-95a9-f0740120aca6','glance through',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"You have only three minutes to glance through this article.\",\"translation\":\"你只能用三分钟很快地看一遍这篇文章。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'匆匆看一遍','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bb83f8e9-8533-4fe6-b3b2-c61d07fc9ae8','homophobia',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /,hɒmə\'fəʊbɪə; ,həʊmə- /；US: /\'homə\'fobɪə /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Personally, I think Adams’s collective work on homophobia is terribly important.\",\"translation\":\"个人来说，我认为亚当斯关于同性恋憎恶的集体工作极其重要。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Over half of the participants admitted to taking out “red flag” words from their grant submission abstracts and titles, inclu