\"sentence\":\"a primary school teacher\",\"translation\":\"小学教师\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"9fc6ea9a-aae5-49c1-8104-6b2c8faca5dc\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','教师, 老师, 导师','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bbbb8a30-c95a-49fe-b67c-b0f7f204e3af','scurvy',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'skɜːvɪ /；US: /\'skɝvi /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"In humans, vitamin C deficiency causes scurvy, and can eventually cause death.\",\"translation\":\"人类缺乏维生素C会引起坏血病，最终导致死亡。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Not eating enough of them can result in problems such as scurvy, dermatitis or dry, scaly skin.\",\"translation\":\"维生素摄入不足能导致坏血病、皮肤炎或干燥、鳞状皮肤之类的问题。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Without the vitamin, scurvy would bring on rashes and gum disease, not to mention very bad breath.\",\"translation\":\"而坏血病就是由于缺乏维他命而导致的，会引起皮疹，牙周病的症状，口臭就更不在话下。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"dd332b73-dcc3-44f8-b813-2b0368005ece\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"1120bf4a-a917-4975-bea4-48614828a4fc\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','坏血病','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bbbdd5fc-1a07-40dc-adec-2d9d48462e75','sincerity',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /sɪn\'serətɪ /；US: /sɪn\'sɪərəti /','[{\"phrase\":\"in all sincerity\",\"translation\":\"非常真诚地；衷心地\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"I don’t doubt her sincerity, but I think she’s got her facts wrong.\",\"translation\":\"我不怀疑她的诚意，但我认为她没弄清楚事实。\"},{\"sentence\":\"May I say in all sincerity that we could not have achieved this much without your help and support.\",\"translation\":\"请允许我真心诚意地说: 没有你们的帮助和支持，我们就不可能取得这样的成绩。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2237ed48-d000-4b8f-830d-90e53f3336e4\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','诚挚，真挚','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bbc228f9-db1a-46a8-b2c4-8c8cf6350176','voice mail',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Communications that show up in your voice mail, or by email, courier, express mail, or snail mail should be welcome, too.\",\"translation\":\"通过语音邮件，电子邮件，信差，快递或普通邮件传递给你的信息都是受欢迎的（好的消息吧）。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The same goes for filing, checking voice mail, updating our calendars, checking our calendars, checking stats on stocks or web traffic, all of these tasks can and should be batched.\",\"translation\":\"与此类似的还有文件归档，查看语音邮件，更新日程表，检查日程表，留意股市信息或是网络交易信息，所有这些工作可以而且应该打包处理。\"},{\"sentence\":\"One is that customer service was an early and inevitable casualty when retailers responded to brutal competition by replacing employees with technology such as 1～800 numbers and voice mail.\",\"translation\":\"一方面当零售商应对残酷的竞争用1到800的数目和语音邮件等技术取代员工后，客户服务就成了早期的也是不可避免的受害者。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'语音信箱','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bbc45881-cb72-4127-be64-146b7914b49d','rosebud',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'rəʊzbʌd /；US: /\'rozbʌd /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"When we think we see something, say like a small red rosebud, we think our friend will see the same rosebud, same shape, same size.\",\"translation\":\"当我们觉得我们看到了什么东西，比如说一个红色的小玫瑰花蕾，我们会觉得我们的朋友们看到的也是同样的玫瑰花蕾，同样的颜色，同样的大小。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'玫瑰花蕾','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bbc96d7c-7158-4b50-9141-a0752eaa7429','unhappy',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','junior','UK: /ʌn\'hæpi /；US: /ʌn\'hæpi /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"If you’re so unhappy, why don’t you change jobs?\",\"translation\":\"你要是那么不开心，为什么不换个工作呢？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Leslie had an unhappy childhood.\",\"translation\":\"莱斯利的童年很不幸。\"},{\"sentence\":\"an unhappy marriage\",\"translation\":\"不幸的婚姻\"},{\"sentence\":\"I was desperately unhappy.\",\"translation\":\"我非常不快乐。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you’re so unhappy, why don’t you change jobs?\",\"translation\":\"你要是那么不开心，为什么不换个工作呢？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Leslie had an unhappy childhood.\",\"translation\":\"莱斯利的童年很不幸。\"},{\"sentence\":\"an unhappy marriage\",\"translation\":\"不幸的婚姻\"},{\"sentence\":\"I was desperately unhappy.\",\"translation\":\"我非常不快乐。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"ec61c34d-3262-4568-b2d1-db51eb1650e0\",\"similarity_score\":0.7142857142857143},{\"word_id\":\"8da0748c-4135-45b1-9122-729530eb6050\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333},{\"word_id\":\"bcf1b7a2-bf33-4067-bb2d-b41269bb27fd\",\"similarity_score\":0.3},{\"word_id\":\"bf5aee82-3dde-4a40-968d-9656dc309a30\",\"similarity_score\":0.3}]',NULL,'不快乐的； 不幸的， 悲惨的'