e grey mare.\",\"translation\":\"他骑着一匹灰色的大母马。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He prefers travelling on the subway to riding in a limousine.\",\"translation\":\"他宁愿乘坐地铁出行而不愿乘坐豪华加长轿车。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She took some friends for a ride in the family car.\",\"translation\":\"她用私家车载了朋友们一程。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She learned to ride when she was seven.\",\"translation\":\"她七岁时学会了骑马。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He was riding a large grey mare.\",\"translation\":\"他骑着一匹灰色的大母马。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Can you give me a ride back to town?\",\"translation\":\"你能捎我回镇上吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Sammy had promised to take me for a ride in his truck.\",\"translation\":\"萨米答应让我坐他的卡车去兜风。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I managed to get a ride down to the station.\",\"translation\":\"我设法搭了便车去车站。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We hitched a ride (= got a free ride from a passing vehicle ) into town.\",\"translation\":\"我们拦了一辆便车进城。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"086b5467-27b5-4e05-a74a-89a3d79ddf08\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"5b1df253-3c8f-4ce1-a7aa-b91dcbf6ab5c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"7c179d12-19b9-42cb-aec4-994b48c39747\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"a94d8129-d5ff-475c-9a1a-c947778772dd\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"b75fe90d-8bd9-4e68-9db3-b8c40b32d794\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"c2b649f3-2c1b-4ad4-a86e-c7131578b99c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"fa070fc2-7094-4d1f-94f3-9ad05ace2e91\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"d9d8de05-f64e-43d2-9cad-f2d6b6d763a0\",\"edit_distance\":1}]','骑； 乘','SYLLABUS',NULL),('bc7b6852-e3c1-4194-aac9-6e02d6f26f74','own',NULL,'ADJECTIVE/NOUN/VERB','junior','UK: /əʊn /；US: /on /','[{\"phrase\":\"your own\",\"translation\":\"你自己的\"},{\"phrase\":\"on their own\",\"translation\":\"凭自己的力量，他们自己；静静独处\"},{\"phrase\":\"of his own\",\"translation\":\"他自己的；属于他自己的\"},{\"phrase\":\"of your own\",\"translation\":\"adj. 你自己的\"},{\"phrase\":\"on your own\",\"translation\":\"独立地， 自愿地\"},{\"phrase\":\"own brand\",\"translation\":\"自有品牌；使用自己商标的商品\"},{\"phrase\":\"on his own\",\"tran