r ) .\",\"translation\":\"她玷污了家族的名声。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He felt a deep sense of shame.\",\"translation\":\"他深深地感到羞愧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Maria blushed with shame.\",\"translation\":\"玛丽亚羞得脸都红了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"(= it made her feel ashamed ) , she gained back all the weight she’d lost.\",\"translation\":\"让她感到惭愧的是，她减掉的体重全又长回来了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He’s brought shame on the whole family.\",\"translation\":\"他使全家蒙羞。\"},{\"sentence\":\"(= it should not make you feel ashamed ) saying ‘I don’t know’.\",\"translation\":\"说一句\\\"我不知道”也没什么可难为情的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He felt a deep sense of shame.\",\"translation\":\"他深深地感到羞愧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Maria blushed with shame.\",\"translation\":\"玛丽亚羞得脸都红了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"(= it made her feel ashamed ) , she gained back all the weight she’d lost.\",\"translation\":\"让她感到惭愧的是，她减掉的体重全又长回来了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He’s brought shame on the whole family.\",\"translation\":\"他使全家蒙羞。\"},{\"sentence\":\"(= it should not make you feel ashamed ) saying ‘I don’t know’.\",\"translation\":\"说一句\\\"我不知道”也没什么可难为情的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘She’s failed her test again.’ ‘What a shame!’\",\"translation\":\"“她又没通过测验。”“真遗憾！”\"},{\"sentence\":\"It’s a shame that you have to leave so soon.\",\"translation\":\"你这么快就要走了，真遗憾。\"},{\"sentence\":\"What a shame we missed the wedding.\",\"translation\":\"我们错过了这场婚礼，太可惜了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It’s a shame about the weather.\",\"translation\":\"天气不好，真是遗憾。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I can’t imagine why they canceled your show, Tracy. That’s such a shame .\",\"translation\":\"我搞不懂他们为什么把你的演出取消了，特蕾西。多可惜啊。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"7bc74fa6-27c5-4f8c-9cf3-23158d15570c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"0059419a-e091-4cbf-9096-e52dc542f10d\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"1afb3741-0460-41d4-8ba0-12311bfd2e57\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"960627d6-de3b-4d1c-aae0-7cdb14cb38c0\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"cd392430-19fe-407b-9e49-bb85743d9ebd\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"fe9d441b-e9be-4cb4-8939-67ff6afa14