slation\":\"经常和…在一起；经常见到\"},{\"phrase\":\"see here\",\"translation\":\"[美国口语]听我说；喂(唤起对方注意或表示不赞成)\"},{\"phrase\":\"let\'s see\",\"translation\":\"让我们看看\"},{\"phrase\":\"as you can see\",\"translation\":\"正如你所看到的；你是知道的\"},{\"phrase\":\"see through\",\"translation\":\"识破，看穿\"},{\"phrase\":\"we\'ll see\",\"translation\":\"你我都会明白\"},{\"phrase\":\"nice to see you\",\"translation\":\"很高兴认识你\"},{\"phrase\":\"go and see\",\"translation\":\"去看看\"},{\"phrase\":\"see as\",\"translation\":\"看作为；视…为…\"},{\"phrase\":\"see clearly\",\"translation\":\"看清楚\"},{\"phrase\":\"glad to see you\",\"translation\":\"见到你很高兴\"},{\"phrase\":\"see a movie\",\"translation\":\"v. 看电影\"},{\"phrase\":\"what can you see\",\"translation\":\"你能看见什么\"},{\"phrase\":\"see you tomorrow\",\"translation\":\"明天见\"},{\"phrase\":\"see you soon\",\"translation\":\"再见；待会儿见；希望尽快见到你\"},{\"phrase\":\"as you see\",\"translation\":\"如你所见；可见\"},{\"phrase\":\"see something in someone\",\"translation\":\"看中(或喜欢)某人的某个方面\"},{\"phrase\":\"see things\",\"translation\":\"发生幻觉；见神见鬼\"},{\"phrase\":\"see in\",\"translation\":\"带领……进去\"},{\"phrase\":\"see for oneself\",\"translation\":\"亲眼看；自己去看\"},{\"phrase\":\"see a lot of\",\"translation\":\"经常和…在一起；经常见到\"},{\"phrase\":\"see here\",\"translation\":\"[美国口语]听我说；喂(唤起对方注意或表示不赞成)\"},{\"phrase\":\"let\'s see\",\"translation\":\"让我们看看\"},{\"phrase\":\"as you can see\",\"translation\":\"正如你所看到的；你是知道的\"},{\"phrase\":\"see through\",\"translation\":\"识破，看穿\"},{\"phrase\":\"we\'ll see\",\"translation\":\"你我都会明白\"},{\"phrase\":\"nice to see you\",\"translation\":\"很高兴认识你\"},{\"phrase\":\"go and see\",\"translation\":\"去看看\"},{\"phrase\":\"see as\",\"translation\":\"看作为；视…为…\"},{\"phrase\":\"see clearly\",\"translation\":\"看清楚\"},{\"phrase\":\"glad to see you\",\"translation\":\"见到你很高兴\"},{\"phrase\":\"see a movie\",\"translation\":\"v. 看电影\"},{\"phrase\":\"what can you see\",\"translation\":\"你能看见什么\"},{\"phrase\":\"see you tomorrow\",\"translation\":\"明天见\"},{\"phrase\":\"see you soon\",\"translation\":\"再见；待会儿见；希望尽快见到你\"},{\"phrase\":\"as you see\",\"translation\":\"如你所见；可见\"},{\"phrase\":\"see something in someone\",\"translation\":\"看中(或喜欢)某人的某个方面\"},{\"phrase\":\"see things\",\"translation\":\"发生幻觉；见神见鬼\"},{\"phrase\":\"see in\",\"translation\":\"带领……进去\"},{\"phrase\":\"see for oneself\",\"translation\":\"亲眼看；自己去看\"},{\"phrase\":\"see a lot of\",\"translation\":\"经常和…在一起；经常见到\"},{\"phrase\":\"see here\",\"translation\":\"[美国口语]听我说；喂(唤起对方注意或表示不赞成)\"},{\"phrase\":\"let\'s see\",\"translation\":\"让我们看看\"},{\"phrase\":\"as you can see\",\"translation\":\"正如你所看到的；你是知道的\"},{\"phrase\":\"see through\",\"translation\":\"识破，看穿\"},{\"phrase\":\"we\'ll see\",\"translation\":\"你我都会明白\"},{\"phrase\":\"nice to see you\",\"translation\":\"很高兴认识你\"},{\"phrase\":\"go and see\",\"translation\":\"去看看\"},{\"phrase\":\"see as\",\"translation\":\"看作为；视…为…\"},{\"phrase\":\"see clearly\",\"translation\":\"看清楚\"},{\"phrase\":\"glad to see you\",\"translation\":\"见到你很高兴\"},{\"phrase\":\"see a movie\",\"translation\":\"v. 看电影\"},{\"phrase\":\"what can you see\",\"translation\":\"你能看见什么\"},{\"phrase\":\"see you tomorrow\",\"translation\":\"明天见\"},{\"phrase\":\"see you soon\",\"translation\":\"再见；待会儿见；希望尽快见到你\"},{\"phrase\":\"as you see\",\"translation\":\"如你所见；可见\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"The moment we saw the house, we knew we wanted to buy it.\",\"translation\":\"我们一看到这房子就知道我们要买。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He crouched down so he couldn’t be seen.\",\"translation\":\"他蹲下来好让别人看不见他。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Can I see your ticket, please?\",\"translation\":\"我能看看你的票吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I saw the offer advertised in the newspaper.\",\"translation\":\"我在报纸上看到这个减价的广告。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Have you seen Chris (= do you know where he is ) ?\",\"translation\":\"你见过克里斯吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"The accommodation was so awful it had to be seen to be believed (= you would not believe it if you did not see it yourself ) .\",\"translation\":\"住宿条件太糟了，不是亲眼所见是不会相信的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I see what you mean (= I understand what you are saying ) .\",\"translation\":\"我明白你的意思。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘He lives here but works in London during the week.’ ‘Oh, I see (= I understand ) .’\",\"translation\":\"“他住在这里，但平时都在伦敦上班。”“噢，我明白了。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"You see, the thing is, I’m really busy right now (= used when you are explaining something ) .\",\"translation\":\"你看，问题是我现在真的很忙。\"},{\"sentence\":\"You mix the flour and eggs like this, see (= used to check that someone is listening and understands ) ?\",\"translation\":\"你要这样搅拌面粉和鸡蛋，明白了吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I can’t see the point of (= I do not understand the reason for ) spending so much money on a car.\",\"translation\":\"我看不出花这么多钱买一辆车有什么意义。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Do you see the point I’m making (= do you understand what I’m trying to say ) ?\",\"translation\":\"你明白我说的意思了吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"The other officers laughed, but Nichols couldn’t see the joke .\",\"translation\":\"其他警官都笑了，但尼科尔斯却听不懂有什么好笑。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The moment we saw the house, we knew we wanted to buy it.\",\"translation\":\"我们一看到这房子就知道我们要买。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He crouched down so he couldn’t be seen.\",\"translation\":\"他蹲下来好让别人看不见他。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Can I see your ticket, please?\",\"translation\":\"我能看看你的票吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I saw the offer advertised in the newspaper.\",\"translation\":\"我在报纸上看到这个减价的广告。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Have you seen Chris (= do you know where he is ) ?\",\"translation\":\"你见过克里斯吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"The accommodation was so awful it had to be seen to be believed (= you would not believe it if you did not see it yourself ) .\",\"translation\":\"住宿条件太糟了，不是亲眼所见是不会相信的。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"15edc006-1d0e-4220-b7e0-a39d3df234e5\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"1dd68d39-10a6-4d31-9345-20ebaa4bd06d\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"356e110b-cb17-4f3b-bc38-f54778ecb813\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"76a596df-4f0f-427b-b77c-d605e1524e87\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"94dea0fb-cdc4-4752-a492-80407a391b68\",\"edit_distance\