nswer the phone\",\"translation\":\"接电话\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer the following questions\",\"translation\":\"回答下列问题\"},{\"phrase\":\"wrong answer\",\"translation\":\"答案错误\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer sheet\",\"translation\":\"n. 答案纸\"},{\"phrase\":\"short answer\",\"translation\":\"简答题；简短回答\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer the telephone\",\"translation\":\"接电话\"},{\"phrase\":\"immediate answer\",\"translation\":\"立即应答\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer back\",\"translation\":\"应答，回复；顶嘴\"},{\"phrase\":\"know all the answers\",\"translation\":\"见多识广；自命不凡；好象什么都知道的样子\"},{\"phrase\":\"soft answer\",\"translation\":\"温和的回答；轻轻的回答；委婉的回答\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer key\",\"translation\":\"答案；题解；练习答案（解答）\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer the needs of\",\"translation\":\"满足...需要\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer up\",\"translation\":\"迅速回答\"},{\"phrase\":\"answer phone\",\"translation\":\"留言机，电话录音机；电话留言；接电话\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"She thought for a moment before answering.\",\"translation\":\"她想了一会儿才回答。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He still hadn’t answered my question .\",\"translation\":\"他仍然没有回答我的问题。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘Why don’t you just leave?’ ‘I’d like to,’ she answered, ‘but I have nowhere else to go.’\",\"translation\":\"“你为什么不一走了之？”“我倒是想走，”她回答说，“但是我没有其他地方可去。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"How much was it? Come on, answer me.\",\"translation\":\"多少钱？ 快点告诉我吧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She thought for a moment before answering.\",\"translation\":\"她想了一会儿才回答。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He still hadn’t answered my question .\",\"translation\":\"他仍然没有回答我的问题。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘Why don’t you just leave?’ ‘I’d like to,’ she answered, ‘but I have nowhere else to go.’\",\"translation\":\"“你为什么不一走了之？”“我倒是想走，”她回答说，“但是我没有其他地方可去。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"How much was it? Come on, answer me.\",\"translation\":\"多少钱？ 快点告诉我吧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She thought for a moment before answering.\",\"translation\":\"她想了一会儿才回答。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He still hadn’t answered my question .\",\"translation\":\"他仍然没有回答我的问题。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘Why don’t you just leave?’ ‘I’d like to,’ she answered, ‘but I have nowhere else to go.’\",\"translation\":\"“你为什么不一走了之？”“我倒是想走，”她回答说，“但是我没有其他地方可去。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"How much was it? Come on, answer me.\",\"translation\":\"多少钱？ 快点告诉我吧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"You don’t have to give them an answer now.\",\"translation\":\"你不必现在就给他们答复。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Every time I ask him about it, I get a different answer.\",\"translation\":\"我每次问他此这件事，都得到不同的回答。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She’s still waiting for an answer from the school.\",\"translation\":\"她还在等校方的答复。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The honest answer was that I didn’t know.\",\"translation\":\"坦白回答，我不知道。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He was never able to get a straight answer about why it happened.\",\"translation\":\"事情为什么会发生，他一直没有得到直接的回答。\"},{\"sentence\":\"It’s impossible for me to give you a definite answer at this time.\",\"translation\":\"现在我无法给你明确答复。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The short answer is that it can’t be done.\",\"translation\":\"简单的回答就是做不了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In answer to your question , yes, you can go.\",\"translation\":\"我来回答你的问题，是的，你可以去。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If it’s money you want, the answer is no !\",\"translation\":\"如果你要的是钱，回答是不行！\"},{\"sentence\":\"What was the answer to question 4?\",\"translation\":\"第四题的答案是什么？\"},{\"sentence\":\"She thought for a moment before answering.\",\"translation\":\"她想了一会儿才回答。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He still hadn’t answered my question .\",\"translation\":\"他仍然没有回答我的问题。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘Why don’t you just leave?’ ‘I’d like to,’ she answered, ‘but I have nowhere else to go.’\",\"translation\":\"“你为什么不一走了之？”“我倒是想走，”她回答说，“但是我没有其他地方可去。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"How much was it? Come on, answer me.\",\"translation\":\"多少钱？ 快点告诉我吧。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"c2e2270f-8304-4d09-8520-f86847f67e11\",\"similarity_score\":0.375},{\"word_id\":\"55e2fe8e-8109-4336-a9e0-5681a2740952\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333333333}]','[{\"word_id\":\"feffa2d0-6ee4-4842-87ae-ef506b0cdc56\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','回答；符合；回答；答案；答辩','SYLLABUS',NULL),('c5433afb-af53-4f8e-9395-649173982d2d'