 are threatened by higher ocean temperatures and melting sea ice around the Antarctic, which would in turn hurt the whales’ chances of survival.\",\"translation\":\"在南极地区，由于海洋温度的上升和海冰的融化，露脊鲸主要的食物来源南极磷虾受到了严重威胁，这反过来也危及到了鲸类的生存。\"},{\"sentence\":\"\\\"For whatever reason, they were still hanging out on the Antarctic continent,\\\" Case said in a statement.\",\"translation\":\"“无论是什么原因，它们确实一直在南极大陆上生活，”凯斯在一份声明中说。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"175fe032-4bd4-483e-b5c3-6e128cbb40f3\",\"edit_distance\":1}]','南极地区','SYLLABUS',NULL),('c9370fc6-f877-4dc6-8946-80d5093efba7','rouse',NULL,'VT&N','senior','UK: /raʊz /；US: /raʊz /','[{\"phrase\":\"rouse oneself\",\"translation\":\"奋起；振作精神\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"His banging roused the neighbours.\",\"translation\":\"他重重的关门声把邻居都吵醒了。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2c27c0c4-4540-4404-a26b-0f4de7051e43\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"96cb3f62-8891-4dde-be39-dde4231c521a\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"e17623f8-199f-4c9f-8dc3-a00b1fc0bf43\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"16a8e57b-234f-4f38-aba9-3ae5bbd5aee9\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"2ee9c1a5-ce8d-431d-9476-94f5c1d7e8a2\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"5b1df253-3c8f-4ce1-a7aa-b91dcbf6ab5c\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"780df545-dd6b-443d-a639-1cc77981066c\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"7c179d12-19b9-42cb-aec4-994b48c39747\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','唤醒，觉醒','SYLLABUS',NULL),('c9413552-0d81-4245-944a-f10c4681943c','bedside',NULL,'NOUN','junior','UK: /\'bedsaɪd /；US: /\'bɛd\'saɪd /','[{\"phrase\":\"bedside table\",\"translation\":\"床头柜；床头桌\"},{\"phrase\":\"bedside lamp\",\"translation\":\"床头灯\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"She put a cup of tea down on the bedside table.\",\"translation\":\"她把一杯茶放在了床边的桌子上。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"10416214-1769-4974-8e51-0b7cca6fa5fe\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"3d5cf197-1608-4ce2-8530-71293b06b49c\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','床边；床头','SYLLABUS',NULL),('c94f0d75-8631-4519-a8c6-b15b650731ec','be responsible for',NULL,'','jun