bungee.\",\"translation\":\"所以，毅革曼想出了一个原创的实验范式：SCAD跳，它通常被描述为没有蹦极的蹦极跳。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'蹦极','SYLLABUS',NULL),('d75c55a4-4680-46bd-841f-9c20789a4934','at an end',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"When our day\'s work was at an end we hastened there.\",\"translation\":\"当天工作一结束， 我们就急忙赶到那里。\"},{\"sentence\":\"From this moment all his care and sorrow was at an end, and the father lived in happiness with his children till his death.\",\"translation\":\"从此刻开始他的所有的悲伤和担心都结束了，于是父亲和他的孩子一直过着幸福的生活直到他去世。\"},{\"sentence\":\"\\\"The times are as bad as ever,\\\" she said; \\\"we have just half a loaf left, and when that is gone all love will be at an end.\",\"translation\":\"“时代和以前一样糟糕，”她说；“我们只剩下半条面包了，当这都吃完了，所有的感情就都结束了。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'结束；终结','SYLLABUS',NULL),('d76738a4-a106-41ed-bb3f-03b18a852be8','helmet',NULL,'','primary','UK: /\'helmɪt /；US: /\'hɛlmɪt /','[{\"phrase\":\"safety helmet\",\"translation\":\"安全帽，安全头盔\"},{\"phrase\":\"motorcycle helmet\",\"translation\":\"摩托车头盔\"},{\"phrase\":\"welding helmet\",\"translation\":\"n. 焊工帽；焊工面罩\"},{\"phrase\":\"crash helmet\",\"translation\":\"安全帽；（飞行员，摩托车驾驶员等的）防撞头盔\"},{\"phrase\":\"steel helmet\",\"translation\":\"钢盔\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"The Sword split the Knight\'s helmet and bit him fatally.\",\"translation\":\"剑劈开了骑士的头盔并致命地刺进他。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Instead, he was told the last time that she loved him, got a hug from her, put his helmet on her so that she can live, and die himself...\",\"translation\":\"相反，他叫女孩最后一次说她爱他，最后一次拥抱他，并让她戴上自己的头盔，因而，女孩可以幸免于难，而他自己却离开了人世……\"},{\"sentence\":\"What you definitely need: helmet, appropriate clothing, phone, passport (with visas), water and snacks.\",\"translation\":\"必需品：头盔，适量的衣物，电话，护照和签证，水和点心。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2683ae72-88f0-401c-8498-a0059ddd2035\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','头盔','SYLLABUS',NULL),('d77186ca-0a92-488d-913a-c9425f203312','get fat',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"I don’t want to quit because I will get fat.\",\"translation\":\"我不想戒烟，因为戒烟会让我发胖的。\"},{\"sentenc