as -- he travels through the air in a sleigh pulled by reindeer. He enters each house from the top by sliding down the hole in the fireplace.\",\"translation\":\"小孩子们相信：在圣诞节的前一夜，圣诞老人乘坐驯鹿拉的雪橇从空中而来，他从壁炉的烟囱进入到每家每户，他把给孩子们的圣诞礼物放在圣诞树下。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In 1846, when the word first appeared in the printed record a dashboard was a barrier between the riders of a sleigh or wagon and the flying mud and water coming from a horse’s hooves.\",\"translation\":\"1846年，这个词有记录以来首次出现在印刷材料中，当时它的意思是雪橇或马车底下的挡板，用来防止马蹄把污水和泥巴溅到车夫身上。\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"d1b95742-c0b4-4e07-9663-22d3b3e70852\",\"similarity_score\":1.0}]','[{\"word_id\":\"1916d2e4-1cfb-4118-bf09-e0ceb6c0ab63\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"9c144c7a-c2fd-4224-99df-d08b92f88bfd\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"d1b95742-c0b4-4e07-9663-22d3b3e70852\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','雪车，雪橇','SYLLABUS',NULL),('dbc9643e-8569-4ec2-9620-0e02a7ad530a','generous',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','senior','UK: /\'dʒen(ə)rəs /；US: /\'dʒɛnərəs /','[{\"phrase\":\"be generous with\",\"translation\":\"用…很大方\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous in\",\"translation\":\"乐于……\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous with\",\"translation\":\"用…很大方\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous in\",\"translation\":\"乐于……\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous with\",\"translation\":\"用…很大方\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous in\",\"translation\":\"乐于……\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous with\",\"translation\":\"用…很大方\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous in\",\"translation\":\"乐于……\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous with\",\"translation\":\"用…很大方\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous in\",\"translation\":\"乐于……\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous with\",\"translation\":\"用…很大方\"},{\"phrase\":\"be generous in\",\"translation\":\"乐于……\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"a generous glass of wine\",\"translation\":\"一大杯葡萄酒\"},{\"sentence\":\"a generous glass of wine\",\"translation\":\"一大杯葡萄酒\"},{\"sentence\":\"a generous glass of wine\",\"translation\":\"一大杯葡萄酒\"},{\"sentence\":\"a generous glass of wine\",\"translation\":\"一大杯葡萄酒\"},{\"sentence\":\"She’s always ve