be\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','螺母，螺帽；坚果；难对付的人，难解的问题；采坚果','SYLLABUS',NULL),('de94ff5e-a0ff-42eb-b4eb-23df4eced89d','yourselves',NULL,'PRONOUN','junior','UK: /jɔː\'selvz /；US: /jʊə\'sɛlvz /','[{\"phrase\":\"for yourself\",\"translation\":\"为你自己\"},{\"phrase\":\"by yourself\",\"translation\":\"独自地，单独地\"},{\"phrase\":\"do it yourself\",\"translation\":\"自己动手干\"},{\"phrase\":\"for yourself\",\"translation\":\"为你自己\"},{\"phrase\":\"by yourself\",\"translation\":\"独自地，单独地\"},{\"phrase\":\"do it yourself\",\"translation\":\"自己动手干\"},{\"phrase\":\"for yourself\",\"translation\":\"为你自己\"},{\"phrase\":\"by yourself\",\"translation\":\"独自地，单独地\"},{\"phrase\":\"do it yourself\",\"translation\":\"自己动手干\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Believe in yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"相信你们自己。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I need not press the urgency of the matter on you, as I konw you are fully aware of it yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"我无需向你们强调此事的急迫性，因为我知道，你们自己对此完全了解。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But what is ultimately most important here is that you are asking the question —not just of me but of yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"但是我在这儿说的最重要的是：你们在问那些问题——不仅是问我，而是在问你们自己。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Back to back! Wrap yourselves up!\",\"translation\":\"背对背！把你们自己包起来！\"},{\"sentence\":\"Go and build a house for yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"去为你们自己造一幢房子吧。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Not just for yourselves, but for your generation and generations to come.\",\"translation\":\"不只是为你们自己，而且是为你们一代人以及未来的几代人。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Believe in yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"相信你们自己。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I need not press the urgency of the matter on you, as I konw you are fully aware of it yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"我无需向你们强调此事的急迫性，因为我知道，你们自己对此完全了解。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But what is ultimately most important here is that you are asking the question —not just of me but of yourselves.\",\"translation\":\"但是我在这儿说的最重要的是：你们在问那些问题——不仅是问我，而是在问你们自己。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'你们自己；你们本人（yourself的复数）','SYLLABUS',NULL),('de9990fa-7f5e-4ee0-939e-0c104a4d5854','wayside',NULL,'ADJECTIVE/NOUN','senior','UK: /\'weɪsaɪd /；US: /\'we\'saɪd /','[{\"phrase\":\"fall by the wayside\",\"translation\":\"半途而废；中途退出\"},{\"phrase\":\"fall by the wayside\",\"translation\":\"半途而废；中途退出\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"How is it that the successful motivate themselves to keep at it when others fall by the wayside?\",\"translation\":\"当其他人跌倒在路旁时，他们是如何激发自己坚持下去的？\"},{\"sentence\":\"To instance only one point: till then I had cared very little about plants and flowers, but now I found myself eagerly interested in every blossom, in every growth of the wayside.\",\"translation\":\"只要举个例子就看得出来了：在这之前，我很少留意于草木花卉，可是现在我发现自己对路边每朵绽开的鲜花、每根生长的小草都兴趣十足。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She beheld the minister advancing along the path, entirely alone, and leaning on a staff which he had cut by the wayside.\",\"translation\":\"她看到牧师正沿着小径走来，他只身一人，只是手中接着一根从路边砍下的手杖。\"},{\"sentence\":\"How is it that the successful motivate themselves to keep at it when others fall by the wayside?\",\"translation\":\"当其他人跌倒在路旁时，他们是如何激发自己坚持下去的？\"},{\"sentence\":\"To instance only one point: till then I had cared very little about plants and flowers, but now I found myself eagerly interested in every blossom, in every growth of the wayside.\",\"translation\":\"只要举个例子就看得出来了：在这之前，我很少留意于草木花卉，可是现在我发现自己对路边每朵绽开的鲜花、每根生长的小草都兴趣十足。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She beheld the minister advancing along the path, entirely alone, and leaning on a staff which he had cut by the wayside.\",\"translation\":\"她看到牧师正沿着小径走来，他只身一人，只是手中接着一根从路边砍下的手杖。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'路旁；路旁的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('deb6bc0f-cd72-485b-ad34-732eb8106363','storybook',NULL,'','primary','UK: /\'stɔːrɪbʊk /；US: /\'stɔrɪ\'bʊk /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"colourful storybooks\",\"translation\":\"彩色故事书\"}]',NULL,NULL,'故事书','SYLLABUS',NULL),('debe0680-4e8f-46ae-a897-ca8d5a2835b5','diver',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'daɪvə /；US: /\'daɪvɚ /','[{\"phrase\":\"scuba diver\",\"translation\":\"戴水肺的潜水员\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"Police divers have recovered the body of a sixteen year old boy.\",\"transla