e to say.\",\"translation\":\"他没有更多要说的了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We know nothing about her family.\",\"translation\":\"我们对她的家庭一无所知。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I couldn’t just stand by and do nothing.\",\"translation\":\"我不能就那样袖手旁观。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I promised to say nothing about it to anyone.\",\"translation\":\"我答应这件事对谁也不说。\"},{\"sentence\":\"We’ve heard nothing from her for weeks.\",\"translation\":\"我们好几个星期没有她的音信了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"There’s absolutely nothing to be ashamed of.\",\"translation\":\"根本没有什么好难为情的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘Do you know much about business?’ ‘Nothing at all.’\",\"translation\":\"“你对做生意了解得多吗？”“一窍不通。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"She had eaten virtually nothing at supper.\",\"translation\":\"晚饭她几乎什么也没吃。\"},{\"sentence\":\"There’s nothing wrong with the data.\",\"translation\":\"这些数据没什么差错。\"},{\"sentence\":\"There’s nothing new about this.\",\"translation\":\"这没有什么新鲜的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"A brief search was made but they found nothing untoward.\",\"translation\":\"他们简单地搜查了一番，没发现任何异常。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'没有什么','SYLLABUS',NULL),('df6168d0-129d-4132-8949-bd928ae27720','balanced diet',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"\\\"Chocolate in moderation can be a fun part of a balanced diet, as a treat, \\\" the spokesperson said.\",\"translation\":\"这位发言人说，“适量食用巧克力可能作为享受，成为均衡饮食有趣的组成部分。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"While a multivitamin is a good addition to any balanced diet, individual supplements and vitamin pills may not be as well absorbed by the body as nutrients in foods.\",\"translation\":\"虽然多种维他命剂是对均衡饮食的有益补充，但人体对单独的补充剂和维他命片剂的吸收情况不如食物中的营养那么好。\"},{\"sentence\":\"McDonald\'s says its food can be part of a balanced diet.\",\"translation\":\"麦当劳说它的食物可以成为均衡饮食的一个部分。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'平衡膳食','SYLLABUS',NULL),('df64cf34-f666-48b0-994d-1f69d0558c11','spacious',NULL,'ADJECTIVE','senior','UK: /\'speɪʃəs /；US: /\'speʃəs /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"a spacious living area\",\"translation\":\"宽敞的居住空间\"}]','[{\"word_id\":\"a5879bc5-195c-4182-9e96-5ac600c55632\",\"similarity_score\":0.3333333333