g girl loved to play with her playmates.\",\"translation\":\"这个小女孩喜欢和她的玩伴们一起玩。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'玩伴；游伴','SYLLABUS',NULL),('dfd4594e-5250-47a8-804d-1f12b1986abc','seaweed',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'siːwiːd /；US: /\'si\'wid /','[{\"phrase\":\"seaweed soup\",\"translation\":\"紫菜汤\"},{\"phrase\":\"seaweed soup\",\"translation\":\"紫菜汤\"},{\"phrase\":\"seaweed soup\",\"translation\":\"紫菜汤\"},{\"phrase\":\"seaweed soup\",\"translation\":\"紫菜汤\"},{\"phrase\":\"seaweed soup\",\"translation\":\"紫菜汤\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"So the next time you see a chunk of seaweed ... notice the beauty of it, yes.\",\"translation\":\"所以下次你碰见一大片海藻时，要毫不犹豫的欣赏它的美。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The crabs come closer to shore at this time of year, Child said, where they feed on the seaweed.\",\"translation\":\"这些螃蟹每年这个时间，要来到这里海岸的边上，恰尔特说，它们以吃海藻为生。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Land that was once at the bottom of the sea now lies around the town in wide, fertile fields; where crabs once crawled, donkeys pick their way; in place of seaweed, roses grow.\",\"translation\":\"曾经是海底的陆地现在成了广阔肥沃的田野，在城市的四周伸展开来，这里曾经有过螃蟹爬行，现在则有驴子择路而行，生长出了海藻和玫瑰花。\"},{\"sentence\":\"So the next time you see a chunk of seaweed ... notice the beauty of it, yes.\",\"translation\":\"所以下次你碰见一大片海藻时，要毫不犹豫的欣赏它的美。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The crabs come closer to shore at this time of year, Child said, where they feed on the seaweed.\",\"translation\":\"这些螃蟹每年这个时间，要来到这里海岸的边上，恰尔特说，它们以吃海藻为生。\"},{\"sentence\":\"In many places, like Japan, people get iodine from seafood, seaweed, vegetables grown in iodine-rich soil or animals that eat grass grown in that soil.\",\"translation\":\"像日本等许多地方，人们通过食用海鲜、海藻得到碘，还可以从生长在高碘土壤里的蔬菜或食草动物那里得到碘。\"},{\"sentence\":\"...seaweed washed up on a beach.\",\"translation\":\"…被冲上海滩的海草。\"},{\"sentence\":\"So the next time you see a chunk of seaweed ... notice the beauty of it, yes.\",\"translation\":\"所以下次你碰见一大片海藻时，要毫不犹豫的欣赏它的美。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The crabs come closer to shore at this time of year, Child said, where they feed on the seaweed.\"