天然气，而我们需要这些东西。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If someone has tons of longevity marks, I start to worry about what insurance companies and others would do.\",\"translation\":\"如果人有许多长寿标记的话，我开始担心保险公司和别人该做些什么了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"For a New Year’s resolution, we should all consider following suit. I found a great website at [LiveVegan.org] that has recipes and tons of other useful information.\",\"translation\":\"作为一个新年决心，我们都应该考虑照着做，我发现一个极好的网站 —— 充满生命力的纯素食者 —— 这里有食谱和许多其它有用的资料。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'许多；很多','SYLLABUS',NULL),('e445a448-1b9d-4e64-87f3-3b0e0ee165f0','recount',NULL,'NOUN/VERB','senior','UK: /rɪ\'kaʊnt /；US: /rɪ\'kaʊnt /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"The defeated candidate demanded a recount.\",\"translation\":\"落选的候选人要求重新计票。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He then recounted the story of the interview for his first job.\",\"translation\":\"他然后叙述了有关他第一份工作面试的故事。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"ea8b76f1-a688-4973-b3aa-fbe415631245\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"0676c7eb-9845-4cad-943d-fe4f9579a8d5\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"af37a1cc-9064-4ce1-ba4b-0399ca7cab19\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','重新计算选票；叙述','SYLLABUS',NULL),('e45786c7-a3f1-4cce-832e-217dc7225e25','be good at…',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"12ac40da-b956-4f1f-a1bb-c5448f716894\",\"edit_distance\":1}]','擅长于……','SYLLABUS',NULL),('e45cb463-d8e9-49a5-8d9b-de16b2b76c7a','Telemachus',NULL,'','senior','UK: /ti\'leməkəs; tə- /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Telemachus, in Homer’s story of the Odyssey, tipped his vehicle vertically against a wall, while others removed their wheels in the evening (Gordon, 1978) to prevent warping.\",\"translation\":\"荷马史诗里的忒勒马科斯在晚上把他的车竖直靠墙，而其他的车则被卸去了轮毂以防止变形（戈登，1978）。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'忒勒玛科斯（Odysseus 和 Penelope 之子）','SYLLABUS',NULL),('e45e330e-233e-4949-bea4-27b856b50bb2','now and then',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"This section of the road is so norrow that there are bound to be traffic jams now and then.\",\"translation\":\"这段路太窄， 交通有时不免堵塞。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If they are being honest, they will tell you they barely have the time, energy, and budget to help much beyond a pat on the back now and then.\",\"translation\":\"如果他们说实话，就会告诉你除了偶尔在你背上拍一下表示赞许外，他们几乎没有支持实现新思想的时间、精力和预算。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'偶尔；有时','SYLLABUS',NULL),('e461d5ea-3ea6-4956-a23a-97a654111b86','team',NULL,'NOUN/VERB','junior','UK: /tiːm /；US: /tim /','[{\"phrase\":\"management team\",\"translation\":\"管理团队；经营团队\"},{\"phrase\":\"team spirit\",\"translation\":\"n. 团队精神；合作精神\"},{\"phrase\":\"team work\",\"translation\":\"配合，协力；工作小组；协同工作\"},{\"phrase\":\"football team\",\"translation\":\"足球队\"},{\"phrase\":\"national team\",\"translation\":\"国家队\"},{\"phrase\":\"professional team\",\"translation\":\"专业团队；职业队\"},{\"phrase\":\"team player\",\"translation\":\"具有团队精神的人；良好的合作伙伴；善于团队合作的人\"},{\"phrase\":\"design team\",\"translation\":\"设计组\"},{\"phrase\":\"research team\",\"translation\":\"研究小组；科学研究组\"},{\"phrase\":\"first team\",\"translation\":\"一线队；首发阵容；第一阵容\"},{\"phrase\":\"team member\",\"translation\":\"队员；团队成员\"},{\"phrase\":\"in the team\",\"translation\":\"在队里\"},{\"phrase\":\"project team\",\"translation\":\"项目工作组；攻关队伍\"},{\"phrase\":\"team leader\",\"translation\":\"组长；团队领导\"},{\"phrase\":\"production team\",\"translation\":\"生产队；制作组；生产大队\"},{\"phrase\":\"team building\",\"translation\":\"团队建设\"},{\"phrase\":\"construction team\",\"translation\":\"施工队\"},{\"phrase\":\"on the team\",\"translation\":\"在队里；是…队的成员\"},{\"phrase\":\"team management\",\"translation\":\"团队管理；小组管理\"},{\"phrase\":\"whole team\",\"translation\":\"全队；完整团队\"},{\"phrase\":\"management team\",\"translation\":\"管理团队；经营团队\"},{\"phrase\":\"team spirit\",\"translation\":\"n. 团队精神；合作精神\"},{\"phrase\":\"team work\",\"translation\":\"配合，协力；工作小组；协同工作\"},{\"phrase\":\"football team\",\"translation\":\"足球队\"},{\"phrase\":\"national team\",\"translation\":\"国家队\"},{\"phrase\":\"professional team\",\"translation\":\"专业团队；职业队\"},{\"phrase\":\"team player\",\"translation\":\"具有团队精神的人；良好的合作伙伴；善于团队合作的人\"},{\"phrase\":\"design team\