"},{\"phrase\":\"no matter who\",\"translation\":\"conj. 不管是谁\"},{\"phrase\":\"on the matter\",\"translation\":\"在这件事情上；对这个问题\"},{\"phrase\":\"no matter whether\",\"translation\":\"conj. 无论（不管是）\"},{\"phrase\":\"a matter of time\",\"translation\":\"只是时间问题；某事肯定发生只是时间问题而已\"},{\"phrase\":\"in the matter of\",\"translation\":\"就…而论，在…方面\"},{\"phrase\":\"in a matter of\",\"translation\":\"左右；大约只不过在…之内\"},{\"phrase\":\"no matter which\",\"translation\":\"无论哪一个\"},{\"phrase\":\"dark matter\",\"translation\":\"暗物质\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"If I have to stay late at work tonight, it won’t matter because we can go out another night.\",\"translation\":\"如果今晚我必须工作到很晚的话，那也没关系，我们可以改天晚上再出去。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Does it matter what I think?\",\"translation\":\"我怎么想重要吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Do you think it matters that the cups and saucers don’t match?\",\"translation\":\"你觉得茶杯与杯托不相配要紧吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"campaigning on issues that really matter\",\"translation\":\"以重大问题为竞选议题\"},{\"sentence\":\"Money was the only thing that mattered to him.\",\"translation\":\"对他来说，钱是唯一重要的东西。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I don’t care what it looks like – what matters is that it works.\",\"translation\":\"我不在乎外观——要紧的是它要管用。\"},{\"sentence\":\"At last she was with the man she loved and nothing else mattered .\",\"translation\":\"最终她和她所爱的男人在一起了，其他都无关紧要。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She said very little during the meal. Not that it mattered (= it was not important ) .\",\"translation\":\"她吃饭时话很少，那倒无所谓。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If I have to stay late at work tonight, it won’t matter because we can go out another night.\",\"translation\":\"如果今晚我必须工作到很晚的话，那也没关系，我们可以改天晚上再出去。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Does it matter what I think?\",\"translation\":\"我怎么想重要吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"Do you think it matters that the cups and saucers don’t match?\",\"translation\":\"你觉得茶杯与杯托不相配要紧吗？\"},{\"sentence\":\"campaigning on issues that really matter\",\"translation\":\"以重大问题为竞选议题\"},{\"sentence\":\"Money was the only thing that mattered to him.\",\"translation\":\"对他来说，钱是唯一重要的东西。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I don’t care what it looks like – what matters is that it works.\",\"translation\":\"我不在乎外观——要紧的是它要管用。\"},{\"sentence\":\"At last she was with the man she loved and nothing else mattered .\",\"translation\":\"最终她和她所爱的男人在一起了，其他都无关紧要。\"},{\"sentence\":\"She said very little during the meal. Not that it mattered (= it was not important ) .\",\"translation\":\"她吃饭时话很少，那倒无所谓。\"},{\"sentence\":\"There are more important matters we need to discuss.\",\"translation\":\"我们有更重要的事情需要讨论。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"2c56eaa8-fca5-4788-89ee-94fd15f7539c\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"c6c08b0c-ae78-4089-a9d7-1d43e04674e8\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"42d88289-0e58-4e0f-a2d2-a19206dc8968\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"081abd9b-9d13-4e24-a747-9e8dbd4bcd54\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"0d9bd62b-e0e3-4081-a89a-a88275ae87da\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"f763408c-012b-4d5c-afa4-ec92ce67d719\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"f7f8e26e-1a84-4833-8a6b-d34d9dbf41f0\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','要紧， 有关系；事情，情况；物质；麻烦事，毛病','SYLLABUS',NULL),('ea27219a-3732-4e67-a78c-f15709b27fa8','out of breath',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"When I finally found my bearings, I was standing on Congress avenue, out of breath, smeared up and down with grass stains and dog shit.\",\"translation\":\"当我终于能确定方向时，我发现自己在国会大街上，上气不接下气，草渍和狗屎全身都是。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He exerted preterhuman self-denial in abstaining from finishing him completely; but getting out of breath he finally desisted, and dragged the apparently inanimate body on to the settle.\",\"translation\":\"他使出超人的自制力克制自己，才没有送他的命，可是他终于喘不过气来，罢手了，又把那显然已无生气的身体拖到高背椅子旁边。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Andrew hurried in, slightly out of breath.\",\"translation\":\"安德鲁匆匆进来，有点上气不接下气。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'上气不接下气的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('ea2b8ae9-73fc-4a78-942e-56a6c9b4f71b','rare',NULL,'ADJECTIVE/ADVERB/VI','senior','UK: /reə /；US: /rɛr /','[{\"phrase\":\"rare earth\",\"translation\":\"稀土元素的氧化物\"},{\"phrase\":