\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','残酷的，残忍的；使人痛苦的，让人受难的；无情的，严酷的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('efbf8766-93b6-44b7-9722-f4a549c14951','windsurfing',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'wɪn(d)sɜːfɪŋ /；US: /\'wɪndsɝfɪŋ /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"The island boasts two exceptional beaches: Tung Wan, a popular bathing area with an array of idyllic beach houses and Kwan-yin Wan, known as a windsurfing haven.\",\"translation\":\"岛上自称有着两个特殊的游泳沙滩：东湾，它是一个受欢迎游泳区，具有田园诗般的很多海滨别墅；观音湾，它是是著名帆板运动的避风港。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I went windsurfing most afternoons.\",\"translation\":\"下午我都去风帆冲浪。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He painted nuns driving racing cars and flying balloons, the pope windsurfing, Mona Lisa naked or smoking.\",\"translation\":\"在他的画里，修女驾着赛车和热气球，主教在玩帆板冲浪，蒙娜丽莎（Mona Lisa）要么赤身裸体，要么吞云吐雾。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'风帆滑浪','SYLLABUS',NULL),('efc06953-5ff6-4222-ba74-7ea3b59f3765','Charles Keeling',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"It was Charles Keeling who measured the carbon dioxide content in the atmosphere between 1957 and 1997.\",\"translation\":\"是查尔斯。奎林把1957-1997年期间大气层中二氧化碳的含量作了精确的统计。\"}]',NULL,NULL,'查尔斯•基林','SYLLABUS',NULL),('efc2dbd6-331e-4dfb-9726-82903ff10d0a','bathrobe',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'bɑːθrəʊb /；US: /\'bæθrob /',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"Without bothering to dry off, I pulled on my bathrobe.\",\"translation\":\"还没来得及擦干身子，我就穿上了浴衣。\"},{\"sentence\":\"One lady had a bathrobe around her. Others just had blankets around them.\",\"translation\":\"一位女士只穿着一件睡衣，其他人只围着一条毯子。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The bad news is, Ralph, the patient you saved, hung himself with his bathrobe belt in the bathroom. I am so sorry, but he\'s dead.\",\"translation\":\"但坏消息是你的朋友拉尔夫用浴衣的腰带把自己挂在了浴室，很不幸，他去世了。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Without bothering to dry off, I pulled on my bathrobe.\",\"translation\":\"还没来得及擦干身子，我就穿上了浴衣。\"},{\"sentence\":\"One lady had a bathrobe around her. Others just had blankets around them.\",\"translation\":\"一位女士只穿着一件睡衣，其他人只围着一条毯子。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The bad news is, Ralph, the patient you saved, hung himself with his b