,\"translation\":\"其他国家很可能会效法美国。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The Government should give industry a lead in tackling racism (= show what other people should do ).\",\"translation\":\"政府在处理种族歧视问题上应该为企业树立榜样。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The black population in the 1960s looked to Ali for a lead (= looked to him to show them what they should do ).\",\"translation\":\"20世纪60年代的黑人视阿里为黑人的楷模。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The president and vice president led the mourners.\",\"translation\":\"总统和副总统带领着送葬人群。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He walks with a stick but still leads his soldiers into battle.\",\"translation\":\"尽管他拄着拐杖，但他仍带领士兵上战场。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Nina Ananiashvili and Alexei Fadeyechev from the Bolshoi Ballet dance the leads.\",\"translation\":\"来自莫斯科大剧院芭蕾舞团的妮娜·安娜尼雅什维莉和阿历克谢·费德耶切夫担任主角。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Other countries are likely to follow the U.S.’s lead.\",\"translation\":\"其他国家很可能会效法美国。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The Government should give industry a lead in tackling racism (= show what other people should do ).\",\"translation\":\"政府在处理种族歧视问题上应该为企业树立榜样。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The black population in the 1960s looked to Ali for a lead (= looked to him to show them what they should do ).\",\"translation\":\"20世纪60年代的黑人视阿里为黑人的楷模。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The president and vice president led the mourners.\",\"translation\":\"总统和副总统带领着送葬人群。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He walks with a stick but still leads his soldiers into battle.\",\"translation\":\"尽管他拄着拐杖，但他仍带领士兵上战场。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The U.S. took the lead in declaring war on terrorism.\",\"translation\":\"美国带头向恐怖主义宣战。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Powers was cast in the lead role (= he was chosen to play it ).\",\"translation\":\"鲍尔斯被选中饰演主角。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The horses were led to safety.\",\"translation\":\"马匹被牵到安全的地方。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The president and vice president led the mourners.\",\"translation\":\"总统和副总统带领着送葬人群。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He walks with a stick but still leads his soldiers into battle.\",\"translation\":\"尽管他拄着拐杖，但他仍带领士兵上战场。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"a89d71a5-37a8-44d9-820d-65f465bc8268\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"c8080790-43a8-49f8-a9b6-963279100f4d\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"cb2abc48-c7ef-4cb4-9e9e-54acea9ba5d4\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"d0dc855e-3c36-4170-84db-1b12f8add3fe\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"edb16b65-1951-4e0d-b64f-6662b0af0f9b\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"0c4b87bf-2002-44fc-977b-25b9ca492918\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"12c6373f-4e10-45bf-887c-e53b1ee01231\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"1beee6f8-0231-4093-943d-4149a50f9fd3\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','领导；铅；导线；榜样；领导；致使；引导；指挥；带头的；最重要的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('f5d51f98-fcfb-49f9-b0e1-72462b3a0f2e','short',NULL,'','primary','UK: /ʃɔːt /；US: /ʃɔrt /','[{\"phrase\":\"short of\",\"translation\":\"缺乏；不足；除…以外\"},{\"phrase\":\"in short\",\"translation\":\"总之；简言之\"},{\"phrase\":\"for short\",\"translation\":\"简称；缩写\"},{\"phrase\":\"short time\",\"translation\":\"短时间；不足的工时\"},{\"phrase\":\"short term\",\"translation\":\"[经]短期\"},{\"phrase\":\"short period\",\"translation\":\"adj. 短周期的；短过期的\"},{\"phrase\":\"short supply\",\"translation\":\"供不应求\"},{\"phrase\":\"short circuit\",\"translation\":\"短路；漏电\"},{\"phrase\":\"short for\",\"translation\":\"是…的略称\"},{\"phrase\":\"short on\",\"translation\":\"缺乏；欠缺\"},{\"phrase\":\"cut short\",\"translation\":\"v. 缩短；打断；缩减\"},{\"phrase\":\"short message\",\"translation\":\"短讯；短报文\"},{\"phrase\":\"short distance\",\"translation\":\"短距离；短程\"},{\"phrase\":\"fall short\",\"translation\":\"不符合标准\"},{\"phrase\":\"short story\",\"translation\":\"短篇小说（指一万字以内的小说）\"},{\"phrase\":\"fall short of\",\"translation\":\"达不到；缺乏\"},{\"phrase\":\"short life\",\"translation\":\"短使用期限；短寿命；不耐久的\"},{\"phrase\":\"for a short time\",\"translation\":\"临时的\"},{\"phrase\":\"short hair\",\"translation\":\"短头发\"},{\"phrase\":\"short in\",\"translation\":\"缩短；在…方面短（缺）的\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"a short meeting\",\"translation\":\"一个短会\"},{\"sentence\":\"Morris gave a short laugh.\",\"translation\":\"莫里斯笑了一声。\"},{