rison for drunk-driving get what they deserve .\",\"translation\":\"那些醉酒驾车被送进监狱的人是罪有应得的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"What have I done to deserve this?\",\"translation\":\"我做了什么事，要得到这样的报应？\"},{\"sentence\":\"I’m sorry for the kids. They deserve better (= deserve to be treated in a better way ) .\",\"translation\":\"我为这些孩子感到难过，他们应该过得更好。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Ledley deserves a place in the team.\",\"translation\":\"莱德利应该在队里占有一席之地。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Paula deserves a special mention for all the help she has given us.\",\"translation\":\"应该特别提一下葆拉，她给了我们许多帮助。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I would never hit anyone, even if they deserved it.\",\"translation\":\"我决不会打人，哪怕他欠揍。\"},{\"sentence\":\"What has he done to deserve this punishment ?\",\"translation\":\"他做了什么，竟会受到这样的惩罚？\"},{\"sentence\":\"People who are sent to prison for drunk-driving get what they deserve .\",\"translation\":\"那些醉酒驾车被送进监狱的人是罪有应得的。\"},{\"sentence\":\"This proposal deserves serious consideration.\",\"translation\":\"这个建议值得认真考虑。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"93457e5c-0efb-479b-8db1-2ed52722936f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"ff569a53-4fd6-4d6e-80ca-cff4d03e0ff0\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','应得，值得','SYLLABUS',NULL),('fafa6956-da25-41b1-927f-b31810626299','make up one’s mind',NULL,'','senior','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'下决心；决定','SYLLABUS',NULL),('fafb54f9-e888-44ee-8f59-b8badec052c8','layer',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'leɪə /；US: /\'leɪr /','[{\"phrase\":\"boundary layer\",\"translation\":\"边界层\"},{\"phrase\":\"thin layer\",\"translation\":\"薄层；薄膜层\"},{\"phrase\":\"surface layer\",\"translation\":\"表层\"},{\"phrase\":\"double layer\",\"translation\":\"双层\"},{\"phrase\":\"soil layer\",\"translation\":\"土层；土壤层次\"},{\"phrase\":\"single layer\",\"translation\":\"单层\"},{\"phrase\":\"application layer\",\"translation\":\"[计]应用层\"},{\"phrase\":\"layer thickness\",\"translation\":\"层厚度\"},{\"phrase\":\"oil layer\",\"translation\":\"油层；含油地层；含油层；油膜\"},{\"phrase\":\"ozone layer\",\"translation\":\"【气】臭氧层\"},{\"phrase\":\"outer layer\",\"trans