lation\":\"怪不得你头痛，你昨晚喝太多了。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"81141dd9-2cb8-48aa-901c-1c43ef32e195\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"03a99cd1-3356-4a2e-bc7a-a92aee97a7a9\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"16b66921-c87d-4940-8428-585d3b29571f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"a5b2cf85-eab9-4d2c-90ff-35528431b16f\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"d7d3dbdd-1802-4797-b0d2-884fda0acaea\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"e97f771e-9d04-4719-afc0-e9c380fa0ece\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','惊奇；奇迹；惊愕；怀疑；想知道；惊讶；奇妙的；非凡的','SYLLABUS',NULL),('fd13810e-aad3-498e-b44b-d7873ace6a1c','at the same time',NULL,'','junior','',NULL,'[{\"sentence\":\"You can do anything you want, but not everything at the same time.\",\"translation\":\"你可以完成你想要做的任何事，但你不可能同时完成所有的事。\"},{\"sentence\":\"But men process and express emotions differently than women, and they have no roadmap for how to combine the masculine requirement of being strong and emotional at the same time.\",\"translation\":\"但是，比起女人，男人处理和表达情感的方式很不同，他们对如何将男性对强壮和感情的的需求同时结合起来没有一个规划图。\"},{\"sentence\":\"How do we escape the stereotypes and yet fulfill them at the same time?\",\"translation\":\"我们如何才能跳出这一老套的模式，并同时能好好的完成它们？\"}]',NULL,NULL,'同时','SYLLABUS',NULL),('fd13f4b3-605e-4106-8a36-0632436e24c4','prize',NULL,'ADJECTIVE/NOUN/VERB','junior','UK: /praɪz /；US: /praɪz /','[{\"phrase\":\"nobel prize\",\"translation\":\"诺贝尔奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"first prize\",\"translation\":\"一等奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"nobel peace prize\",\"translation\":\"诺贝尔和平奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"prize winner\",\"translation\":\"得奖者\"},{\"phrase\":\"pulitzer prize\",\"translation\":\"普利策奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"prize money\",\"translation\":\"（旧时出售捕获船货物后分给立功官兵的）捕获物奖金\"},{\"phrase\":\"grand prize\",\"translation\":\"特奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"cash prize\",\"translation\":\"n. 现金奖励（赏）\"},{\"phrase\":\"consolation prize\",\"translation\":\"安慰奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"win first prize\",\"translation\":\"赢得头奖；获一等奖；得第一名\"},{\"phrase\":\"booker prize\",\"translation\":\"布克文学奖\"},{\"phrase\":\"booby prize\",\"t