e to do\",\"translation\":\"承诺做某事\"},{\"phrase\":\"promise to pay\",\"translation\":\"付款承诺\"},{\"phrase\":\"solemn promise\",\"translation\":\"庄严承诺；誓言\"},{\"phrase\":\"promise well\",\"translation\":\"前景很好；很有希望\"},{\"phrase\":\"show great promise\",\"translation\":\"大有前途，大有希望\"},{\"phrase\":\"break a promise\",\"translation\":\"违反诺言\"},{\"phrase\":\"keep a promise\",\"translation\":\"遵守诺言\"},{\"phrase\":\"promise yourself\",\"translation\":\"承诺自己\"},{\"phrase\":\"land of promise\",\"translation\":\"[圣经]上帝允许给亚伯拉罕的地方；乐土；福地；希望之乡（等于Promised Land）\"}]','[{\"sentence\":\"If you make a promise, you should keep it.\",\"translation\":\"如果你许下一个诺言，你就应该遵守它。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The post office has promised to resume first class mail delivery to the area on Friday.\",\"translation\":\"邮局已承诺在星期五恢复该地区第一类邮件的递送。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He had promised that the rich and privileged would no longer get preferential treatment.\",\"translation\":\"他已承诺富人和特权阶层将不会再得到优待。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Promise me you will not waste your time.\",\"translation\":\"向我承诺你不会浪费你的时间。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I\'ll call you back, I promise.\",\"translation\":\"我会给你回电话的，我保证。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Last night the headmaster promised a full investigation.\",\"translation\":\"校长昨晚允诺进行全面调查。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘I’ll be back by 1.00.’ ‘ Promise ?’ ‘Yes! Don’t worry.’\",\"translation\":\"“我1点钟前会回来。”“你保证？”“是的！别担心。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"He reappeared two hours later, as promised.\",\"translation\":\"就像他保证过的，他两小时后再次露面。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you make a promise, you should keep it.\",\"translation\":\"如果你许下一个诺言，你就应该遵守它。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The post office has promised to resume first class mail delivery to the area on Friday.\",\"translation\":\"邮局已承诺在星期五恢复该地区第一类邮件的递送。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He had promised that the rich and privileged would no longer get preferential treatment.\",\"translation\":\"他已承诺富人和特权阶层将不会再得到优待。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Promise me you will not waste your time.\",\"translation\":\"向我承诺你不会浪费你的时间。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I\'ll call you back, I promise.\",\"translation\":\"我会给你回电话的，我保证。\"},{\"sentence\":\"The post office has promised to resume first class mail delivery to the area on Friday.\",\"translation\":\"邮局已承诺在星期五恢复该地区第一类邮件的递送。\"},{\"sentence\":\"He had promised that the rich and privileged would no longer get preferential treatment.\",\"translation\":\"他已承诺富人和特权阶层将不会再得到优待。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Promise me you will not waste your time.\",\"translation\":\"向我承诺你不会浪费你的时间。\"},{\"sentence\":\"I\'ll call you back, I promise.\",\"translation\":\"我会给你回电话的，我保证。\"},{\"sentence\":\"If you make a promise, you should keep it.\",\"translation\":\"如果你许下一个诺言，你就应该遵守它。\"},{\"sentence\":\"Last night the headmaster promised a full investigation.\",\"translation\":\"校长昨晚允诺进行全面调查。\"},{\"sentence\":\"‘I’ll be back by 1.00.’ ‘ Promise ?’ ‘Yes! Don’t worry.’\",\"translation\":\"“我1点钟前会回来。”“你保证？”“是的！别担心。”\"},{\"sentence\":\"He reappeared two hours later, as promised.\",\"translation\":\"就像他保证过的，他两小时后再次露面。\"}]',NULL,'[{\"word_id\":\"bafc39b9-ba3e-4cb1-b8e1-d3e1a0ad22a4\",\"edit_distance\":1},{\"word_id\":\"5fc6d56f-2800-4a85-a15f-222dbf5a95c9\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"3cd360aa-34d4-4d29-92e1-19e0efdb9b22\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"3c2bd001-1238-480e-8dc9-91715e425556\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"8f61e365-1e41-4a12-bfa5-c68c47a846f2\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"b0142eeb-37a7-420e-9acb-8eb292d0f602\",\"edit_distance\":2},{\"word_id\":\"ba3feacf-a225-4668-bbbc-1c4a8984e4ba\",\"edit_distance\":2}]','许诺，允诺；希望；允诺，许诺；给人以…的指望或希望','SYLLABUS',NULL),('fd74e566-f5fc-47c2-829a-a77d0f1851ef','socket',NULL,'NOUN','senior','UK: /\'sɒkɪt /；US: /\'sɑkɪt /','[{\"phrase\":\"eye socket\",\"translation\":\"眼窝；眼眶\"},{\"phrase\":\"switch socket\",\"translation\":\"n. 开关插座；开关灯座\"},{\"phrase\":\"power socket\",\"translation\":\"电源插座\"},{\"phrase\":\"wall socket\",\"translation\":\"壁式插座；壁灯灯座；墙壁插座；壁插座\"},{\"phrase\":\"socket head\",\"translation\":\"插座头；套筒板手头\"},{\"phrase\":\"plug and socket\",\"translation\